
# game/a3s2.rpy:4
translate latin a3s2_ec1e11ca:

    # "I plunge into the water with a splash, the cold taking my breath away in an instant."
    "Cum strepitu in aquam immergor, frigore statim spiritum auferente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:5
translate latin a3s2_7db50ab9:

    # "Immediately, I realize the mistake of jumping into the lake with a heavy robe."
    "Statim intellego me erravisse in lacum gravi toga indutum saliendo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:6
translate latin a3s2_d0e2e678:

    # "I'm able to kick out of the loose fitting garment within a few seconds though, and I start swimming around the edge of the balcony, toward the shore."
    "Sed intra pauca secunda vestimentum laxum pedibus exuere possum; circum marginem maeniani ad litus natare incipio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:7
translate latin a3s2_0a6985ec:

    # "It's not that far, but I start to worry as I feel my arms and legs burn from the strain, and even though the beach is right in front of me, it seems to take longer than it should for my feet to touch ground."
    "Non tam procul est; tamen sollicitus fio cum brachia cruraque labore ardere sentio. Quamquam litus recta ante me est, plus temporis quam oportet praeterire videtur antequam pedes mei solum tangant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:8
translate latin a3s2_e2701f7b:

    # "Just as I feel my limbs start to give out, I feel the sandy bottom of the lake against my toes."
    "Simul atque membra mea deficere incipere sentio, imum lacus harenosum digitis pedum tango."

# game/a3s2.rpy:9
translate latin a3s2_7aaf8e69:

    # "I gasp with relief, struggling through the deeper end of the shallows before stumbling to my hands and knees, forcing myself to move forward until I reach the beach."
    "Levatus spiritum duco, per altiorem partem aquae vadosae luctans, deinde in manus genuaque titubans; me procedere cogo donec litus attingo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:12
translate latin a3s2_5c5cc45b:

    # "Even now, in this moment of desperation, I have to lay out in the sand for a moment, gasping for breath as I feel my numbed limbs come slowly back to life."
    "Etiam nunc in hoc momento desperationis paulisper in harena iacere debeo, graviter spirans dum membra torpentia lente ad vitam redire sentio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:13
translate latin a3s2_ce2ac205:

    # "I suppose all the anxiety and no food all day have left me feeling weak."
    "Credo tantam sollicitudinem atque nullum cibum per totum diem me infirmum fecisse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:14
translate latin a3s2_73154997:

    # "I finally realize how exposed I am out here, how easy it would be for someone to see me from the gardens, or even from the windows of the palace."
    "Tandem intellego quam nudus hic sim, quam facile quis e hortis aut etiam e fenestris palatii me videre possit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:15
translate latin a3s2_b33d1be5:

    # "With a grunt, I force myself to roll over and start crawling for the treeline in the garden so that I can at least have some cover."
    "Fremens me vertere cogo et ad arbores horti repere incipio, ut saltem aliquo tegmine utar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:17
translate latin a3s2_49ab3d1d:

    # "As I crouch there in just my underwear, still trying to catch my breath, I realize how quiet it is out here."
    "Dum ibi subligaculo tantum indutus me contraho, adhuc spiritum recipere conans, intellego quam quietum hic sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:18
translate latin a3s2_1019231d:

    # "Again, it's a striking contrast to how violently things had changed just hours ago."
    "Rursus vehementer differt ab eo quam violenter res ante paucas tantum horas mutatae sint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:19
translate latin a3s2_9e8ca1ac:

    # "Finally, after a deep breath, I start pushing my way through the gardens, walking through the foliage rather than using the paths."
    "Tandem, alte spiritu ducto, per hortos procedere incipio, per frondes ambulans potius quam semitis utens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:20
translate latin a3s2_977559af:

    # "I doubt anyone's taking a garden stroll considering what's happened, but the one thing I've learned is that no one's predictable here."
    "Dubito an quis, rebus gestis consideratis, nunc per hortos ambulans se oblectet; sed hoc didici: nemo hic est cuius mores certe praesciri possint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:21
translate latin a3s2_280a14ce:

    # "So I try to keep hidden, using the large, exotic-looking plants as cover before leaping across paths and ducking into the plant-life again."
    "Itaque occultus manere conor, magnis plantis peregrinae speciei me tegens; deinde trans semitas salio et rursus inter plantas me demitto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:22
translate latin a3s2_6afdb7db:

    # "As I get closer to the palace, I try to think about how I'm going to do this."
    "Dum propius ad palatium accedo, cogitare conor quomodo hoc faciam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:23
translate latin a3s2_7b9bd3c2:

    # "With any luck, no one's actually in the palace."
    "Si fortuna favet, nemo vere in palatio est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:24
translate latin a3s2_a337a35e:

    # "It would make sense after what happened."
    "Id post ea quae acciderunt rationi conveniret."

# game/a3s2.rpy:25
translate latin a3s2_6cd60f06:

    # "If anyone IS in the palace, I just have to hope they aren't Cato."
    "Si quis in palatio EST, tantum sperare debeo eum Catonem non esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:26
translate latin a3s2_2c8d735c:

    # "There's also the problem of actually getting Amicus out of the dungeons."
    "Etiam difficultas est Amicum vere e carcere liberandi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:27
translate latin a3s2_9bc2428e:

    # "While I might be blind to Com, Amicus definitely isn't."
    "Quamquam Computatro invisibilis sim, Amicus certe non est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:28
translate latin a3s2_ddc56ceb:

    # "I need to get to Neferu."
    "Ad Neferu pervenire debeo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:29
translate latin a3s2_b687560e:

    # "He would definitely know about what's happened by now."
    "Iam certe sciet quid acciderit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:30
translate latin a3s2_e2d118a8:

    # "Maybe we could come up with a plan if he doesn't have one already."
    "Fortasse consilium excogitare possimus si nondum habet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:31
translate latin a3s2_69e45d01:

    # "He always seems to know what to do...well, usually."
    "Semper scire videtur quid faciendum sit...sane, plerumque."

# game/a3s2.rpy:32
translate latin a3s2_12c144dc:

    # "I just have to hope that something hasn't happened to him."
    "Tantum sperare debeo nihil ei accidisse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:33
translate latin a3s2_b96d8445:

    # "So, as I come up to the palace entrance, I look around, the quiet starting to become unnerving."
    "Itaque, dum ad palatii aditum accedo, circumspicio; silentium iam me turbare incipit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:34
translate latin a3s2_16cb0a1a:

    # "I don't see anyone so, swallowing hard, I jog through the entrance of the palace."
    "Neminem video; graviter deglutiens, per aditum palatii paulum curro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:36
translate latin a3s2_58148b78:

    # "The cool air of the hallways hits my damp skin and makes me shiver, both from the cold and the tension."
    "Frigidus aer ambulacrorum cutem umidam percutit et me tremere facit, et frigore et sollicitudine."

# game/a3s2.rpy:37
translate latin a3s2_4b9c0463:

    # "I'm sure to keep close to the walls, always looking ahead to a doorway or pillar that I can duck behind in case I see someone."
    "Prope parietes manere curo, semper ante me ad ianuam aut columnam spectans post quam me demittere possim si quem videam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:38
translate latin a3s2_b4b0bf79:

    # "Luckily, that doesn't happen, and I'm more and more convinced that no one is actually here."
    "Feliciter id non accidit; magis magisque persuadetur mihi neminem vere hic esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:39
translate latin a3s2_ed263fcd:

    # "Before I know it, I'm coming up on the hall that holds Neferu's room."
    "Antequam intellego, ad ambulacrum in quo cubiculum Neferu est accedo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:40
translate latin a3s2_73f80a7f:

    # "My breathing quickens as I get closer to the door, knowing that I'll feel a lot better if I can just have some guidance."
    "Respiratio mea acceleratur dum ianuae appropinquo; scio me multo melius sensurum esse si tantum aliquis me ducere possit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:41
translate latin a3s2_8c1dc149:

    # "I've been here for a while and I've gotten used to the way of things, but I'm completely out of my element now."
    "Aliquamdiu hic fui et moribus adsuevi; sed nunc omnino extra res notas sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:42
translate latin a3s2_29690d26:

    # "I make it to the door and reach out, pressing the panel to slide it open."
    "Ad ianuam pervenio et manum porrigo, tabulam premens ut aperiatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:45
translate latin a3s2_15593824:

    # "The room is empty."
    "Cubiculum vacuum est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:46
translate latin a3s2_e126149b:

    # "I stare for a moment, as if doing that will make the jackal magically appear back in his bed where I last saw him."
    "Paulisper intueor, quasi eo faciam ut chacalus arte magica rursus in lecto appareat, ubi eum ultimo vidi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:47
translate latin a3s2_9f06f521:

    # "Then I see something on the floor:"
    "Tum aliquid in solo video:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:48
translate latin a3s2_25eb6d6e:

    # "Green shards of shattered glass; wine bottles knocked from the table to the floor."
    "Viridia fragmenta vitri fracti: lagenae vini e mensa in solum deiectae."

# game/a3s2.rpy:49
translate latin a3s2_2cd28496:

    # "An ominous feeling starts to blossom in my chest as I note the purplish-red stains amongst the glass, the spilled wine dried from how long it's been there."
    "Sinistrum sensum in pectore nasci sentio, dum maculas purpureo-rubras inter vitri fragmenta animadverto; vinum effusum siccum est, tam diu ibi iacuit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:50
translate latin a3s2_b960b112:

    # "I swallow again to wet my throat, looking to the ceiling, about to call out to Com and ask for Neferu's location before stopping myself."
    "Rursus deglutio ut fauces madefaciam, ad tectum spectans; iam Com vocaturus sum et rogaturus ubi Neferu sit, sed me retineo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:51
translate latin a3s2_eb9407b7:

    # "I don't know if actually alerting Com to my location is a good idea."
    "Nescio num vere Computatrum de loco meo certiorem facere bonum consilium sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:52
translate latin a3s2_69e5f481:

    # "I'm pretty sure the security portion of the AI is separate from the rest of Com, but I don't want to chance it."
    "Satis certus sum partem securitatis intellegentiae artificialis a reliquo Computatro separatam esse, sed periculum facere nolo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:53
translate latin a3s2_f3b4b92d:

    # "I stand there for a moment, unsure of what to do now."
    "Paulisper ibi sto, incertus quid nunc agam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:54
translate latin a3s2_269df705:

    # "I could go around the palace looking for the jackal."
    "Possem per palatium ire, chacalum quaerens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:55
translate latin a3s2_21329e6f:

    # "He could be anywhere, really."
    "Re vera ubivis esse potest."

# game/a3s2.rpy:56
translate latin a3s2_d26e6b25:

    # "But seeing the glass, knowing what's happened..."
    "Sed vitrum videns, sciens quid acciderit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:57
translate latin a3s2_695e2eb8:

    # "...I'm just denying what's obvious here."
    "...tantum quod hic manifestum est nego."

# game/a3s2.rpy:58
translate latin a3s2_b9382c6c:

    # "I just have to hope that he's okay, wherever he's been taken."
    "Tantum sperare debeo eum bene valere, quocumque abductus est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:59
translate latin a3s2_31312df0:

    # "I lean against the frame of the door for a moment, trying to think of what to do next."
    "Paulisper ianuae postibus innitor, cogitare conans quid deinde faciam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:60
translate latin a3s2_c54559de:

    # "I could look for Virginia, but I have no idea where her room might be."
    "Virginiam quaerere possim, sed omnino nescio ubi cubiculum eius sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:61
translate latin a3s2_155652e7:

    # "Besides, if the state of Neferu's room is anything to go by, I wouldn't be surprised if she's been taken somewhere against her will as well."
    "Praeterea, si status cubiculi Neferu quidquam significat, non mirarer eam quoque invitam alio abductam esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:62
translate latin a3s2_4e0a377e:

    # "Cato probably knows everything about what we were planning."
    "Cato probabiliter omnia consilia nostra novit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:63
translate latin a3s2_91fe0a61:

    # "There's really no other choice but to go into the dungeons, tell Amicus about what's happened, then maybe he'll know what to do."
    "Nulla vere alia electio est nisi in carceres ire, Amico narrare quid acciderit, deinde fortasse ille sciet quid faciamus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:64
translate latin a3s2_7356fedf:

    # "Just as I'm turning to go back out into the hall though, I hear footsteps."
    "Sed dum me verto ut rursus in ambulacrum exeam, vestigia audio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:65
translate latin a3s2_232d134f:

    # "I quickly draw back into the room, reaching up to the panel to shut the door again."
    "Cito in cubiculum recedo, manum ad tabulam tollens ut ianuam rursus claudam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:66
translate latin a3s2_19278696:

    # "Before I do though, I hear something else."
    "Sed antequam facio, aliud audio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:67
translate latin a3s2_3acaba53:

    # "The sound of muttering in a very familiar voice."
    "Sonum murmurantis familiari admodum voce."

# game/a3s2.rpy:68
translate latin a3s2_3c33e14a:

    # "I linger just inside the room, listening as the voice draws closer."
    "Paulum intra cubiculum moror, auscultans dum vox propius venit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:69
translate latin a3s2_8698c218:

    # al "\"Oh dear, oh Galen, this is too much...too much!\""
    al "\"O di boni, o Galen, hoc nimium est...nimium!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:70
translate latin a3s2_f0289194:

    # "I grit my teeth, listening as the cat comes closer, sounding like he's alone."
    "Dentes comprimo, felem propius venientem audiens; solus esse videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:71
translate latin a3s2_b5c7d061:

    # "I suddenly make up my mind as to what I'm going to do next."
    "Subito statuo quid deinde faciam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:72
translate latin a3s2_3d5134f1:

    # al "\"I'm going to be killed...I'm going to be killed...what was I THINKING!?\""
    al "\"Interficiar...interficiar...quid COGITABAM!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:73
translate latin a3s2_7c2aaa10:

    # "At that moment, the cat passes the doorway."
    "Illo momento felis ianuam praeterit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:74
translate latin a3s2_2b7ae484:

    # "He's got his paws up to the sides of his face, too busy staring at the ground to even notice me."
    "Manus iuxta latera faciei sustinet, nimis solum spectando occupatus ut vel me animadvertat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:75
translate latin a3s2_46330766:

    # "He's close enough that all I have to do is reach out and grab him by the straps of his robe before yanking him into the room as hard as I can."
    "Tam prope est ut tantum manum porrigere et eum tunicae loris prehendere debeam, deinde quam vehementissime in cubiculum trahere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:76
translate latin a3s2_7e7b039b:

    # "Immediately, the cat shrieks, the sound bending comically with the force of my tug."
    "Statim felis clamat, sono comice vi tractionis meae flexo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:77
translate latin a3s2_5421b0ec:

    # "I swing him around toward the middle of the room before turning around to quickly shut the door."
    "Eum circa me ad medium cubiculum verto, deinde me verto ut cito ianuam claudam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:79
translate latin a3s2_b209fc99:

    # "Alex is still yelling as he tumbles to the ground, rolling several times before coming to a stop next to the shattered bottles."
    "Alex adhuc clamat dum in pavimentum cadit, aliquoties se volvens antequam iuxta fractas lagenas consistit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:80
translate latin a3s2_4a92119f:

    # "He curls up there, covering his face as he cowers on the ground."
    "Ibi se contrahit, faciem tegens dum in solo timidus iacet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:82
translate latin a3s2_90c786a4:

    # al "\"Wait! Wait! I'm sorry for whatever it is that I did!\""
    al "\"Exspecta! Exspecta! Ignosce mihi propter quidquid feci!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:83
translate latin a3s2_1b23529f:

    # "The cat continues to grovel before finally peeking through his paws to look up at me."
    "Felis supplicare pergit, antequam tandem inter manus ad me sursum spectat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:84
translate latin a3s2_6d46b8c0:

    # "He goes quiet, though he remains fetal, as if deciding if he should still be scared or not."
    "Tacet, quamquam adhuc contractus iacet, quasi deliberet num adhuc timere debeat necne."

# game/a3s2.rpy:85
translate latin a3s2_50f2efd5:

    # "Suddenly, he seems to make up his mind and quickly stands, brushing off imaginary dust as he fixes his face into one of bland disinterest."
    "Subito statuisse videtur et cito surgit, fictum pulverem detergens dum vultum sic componit quasi nihil ipsi referat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:87
translate latin a3s2_6e43180a:

    # al "\"Oh [mc], I thought you might be someone else. My apologies.\""
    al "\"O [mc], putabam te fortasse alium esse. Veniam peto.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:88
translate latin a3s2_c4ccab7b:

    # "I glare."
    "Iratus specto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:89
translate latin a3s2_e26e214d:

    # al "\"What reason did you have for grabbing me so roughly?\""
    al "\"Quam causam habebas me tam dure capiendi?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:90
translate latin a3s2_320aabbf:

    # m "\"No, no more bullshitting from you. What the hell is going on?\""
    m "\"Non, iam nullae nugae a te. Quid tandem accidit?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:91
translate latin a3s2_c864a57f:

    # "The cat finally stops fidgeting and faces me, though he doesn't make eye contact, staring at the door behind me instead."
    "Felis tandem inquietus moveri desinit et ad me se vertit; tamen oculos meos non aspicit, sed ianuam post me intuetur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:93
translate latin a3s2_d79c7294:

    # al "\"Well, I'm sure you already know that, don't you? I'm surprised Cato let you out, to be honest.\""
    al "\"Bene, certe iam scis, nonne? Miror Catonem te emisisse, ut verum dicam.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:94
translate latin a3s2_a4d4141c:

    # "Something about Alex's demeanor, not only the way he's acting now, but the way he's been acting for the past month, gets to me at that moment."
    "Aliquid in moribus Alex, non tantum quo modo nunc agit, sed quo modo superiore mense egit, illo momento me tangit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:95
translate latin a3s2_2d1c0daf:

    # "I step forward suddenly, and though I want to hit him, I settle with just giving him a hard shove in the chest that sends him stumbling back with a noisy slapping of his sandals on the stone floor."
    "Subito procedo; quamquam eum ferire volo, tantum pectus eius vehementer impello, eum retro titubare faciens, soleis clare solum lapideum pulsantibus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:97
translate latin a3s2_970112bd:

    # m "\"What the FUCK, Alex!?\""
    m "\"Quid, MEHERCULE, Alex!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:99
translate latin a3s2_286953c5:

    # "He windmills his arms, trying to catch his balance, and when he finally does, he brings his paws up to his chest, his ears pinned back and claws unsheathed."
    "Brachia in orbem agitat, aequilibrium recipere conans; cum tandem recipit, manus ad pectus tollit, auribus retrorsum pressis et unguibus protractis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:101
translate latin a3s2_88d8708f:

    # "I don't know if Alex is any good at fighting, but I'd rather not get raked by those things, so I hold off on giving him another shove."
    "Nescio num Alex bene pugnare possit, sed malo illis non lacerari, itaque eum rursus impellere nolo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:102
translate latin a3s2_4b3085a8:

    # "Besides, he's looking scared again, staring at me wide-eyed."
    "Praeterea rursus territus videtur, oculis dilatatis me spectans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:103
translate latin a3s2_012f716c:

    # al "\"D—don't touch me!\""
    al "\"N—noli me tangere!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:104
translate latin a3s2_52866265:

    # "I grit my teeth, forcing myself not to do it again."
    "Dentes comprimo, me cohibens ne iterum idem faciam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:105
translate latin a3s2_a743a4d5:

    # m "\"Then tell me what it is that you're doing. Why did you do this?\""
    m "\"Ergo mihi dic quid facias. Cur hoc fecisti?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:106
translate latin a3s2_07682022:

    # al "\"What?\""
    al "\"Quid?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:107
translate latin a3s2_ab94b40b:

    # "This time I step forward and raise my fist threateningly, and immediately the cat covers his face, cowering."
    "Hoc tempore procedo et pugnum minaciter tollo; statim felis faciem tegit, timidus se contrahens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:109
translate latin a3s2_5508eb66:

    # "I realize then that Alex probably doesn't have any fighting skills at all."
    "Tum intellego Alex probabiliter nullam artem pugnandi habere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:110
translate latin a3s2_eb9a4e3b:

    # "That he might actually be a coward rather than just pretending to be one."
    "Eum fortasse vere ignavum esse potius quam tantum hoc simulare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:111
translate latin a3s2_8ad74003:

    # "This realization cools my desire to really hurt the cat."
    "Haec conscientia cupiditatem vere felem laedendi refrigerat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:112
translate latin a3s2_17d554ad:

    # "Instead, I just wait again until Alex lowers his paw, looking at me with fear."
    "Tantum rursus exspecto donec Alex manum demittit, me timide spectans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:114
translate latin a3s2_8235d688:

    # "I guess that's a good thing."
    "Credo id bonum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:115
translate latin a3s2_b2eb0f6c:

    # "Amicus had told me in the past that the few sapient primates in the {i}Galaxias{/i} are really only known for a few things, one being that they can't swim, and the other being their incredible strength."
    "Amicus olim mihi dixerat paucos primates sapientes in {i}Galaxias{/i} paucis tantum rebus notos esse: quod natare nequeant et quod incredibilibus viribus praediti sint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:116
translate latin a3s2_b30de4b9:

    # "I suppose it's a good reputation to have, even if it's not true for humans, but Alex wouldn't know that."
    "Credo bonam famam esse, etiamsi hominibus non vera est; sed Alex id nesciret."

# game/a3s2.rpy:117
translate latin a3s2_1cfea481:

    # "I take another threatening step forward."
    "Alium minacem passum facio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:118
translate latin a3s2_b4db924c:

    # m "\"TELL me.\""
    m "\"DIC mihi.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:120
translate latin a3s2_ea57d4e2:

    # al "\"Alright!\""
    al "\"Bene!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:121
translate latin a3s2_4c217d76:

    # "I'm surprised by the cat's sudden exclamation, his eyes screwed shut as he raises his paws to his head fur, tugging at it in distress."
    "Miror subitam felis exclamationem; oculis arcte clausis manus ad capitis pilos tollit et eos perturbatus trahit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:122
translate latin a3s2_19fe6af8:

    # al "\"I'll tell you whatever it is you want if you just leave me alone! I'm tired of this goddamn palace and psychopathic wolves and half-developed children!\""
    al "\"Quidquid vis tibi dicam, si tantum me relinquas! Me taedet huius maledicti palatii et Luporum insanorum et Liberorum semiexcultorum!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:123
translate latin a3s2_99acda89:

    # "I ignore that jab at me, staring at the cat, waiting."
    "Illam contumeliam mihi datam neglego, felem spectans et exspectans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:125
translate latin a3s2_17067b58:

    # al "\"I'll probably be deported soon anyway...if not executed.\""
    al "\"Tamen probabiliter mox expellar...nisi interficiar.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:126
translate latin a3s2_ce313bf6:

    # "The cat's voice catches in his throat, and he raises a paw to his mouth, seemingly about to cry again."
    "Vox felis in gutture haeret; manum ad os tollit, quasi rursus flere incipiat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:127
translate latin a3s2_2ec0b62d:

    # "He really is scared, and that gives me an idea."
    "Vere timet, et hoc consilium mihi dat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:128
translate latin a3s2_7e152af3:

    # m "\"Listen...I'm trying to help Amicus to his rightful place on the throne...maybe if you help me out, and Amicus does become emperor, I can work something out for you. You know how close the two of us are.\""
    m "\"Audi...Amicum adiuvare conor ut solium, quod iure ei debetur, obtineat...fortasse, si me adiuvas et Amicus imperator fit, aliquid pro te componere possum. Scis quam coniuncti simus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:129
translate latin a3s2_32f228cd:

    # "I wait as he tries to gather himself, clasping his paws together before simply looking at the ground."
    "Exspecto dum se colligere conatur; manus inter se iungit, deinde tantum pavimentum aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:130
translate latin a3s2_bf2d8c8f:

    # "He doesn't say anything though, so I sigh."
    "Sed nihil dicit, itaque suspiro."

# game/a3s2.rpy:131
translate latin a3s2_cd3021fa:

    # m "\"Why did you tell Cato about our plan?\""
    m "\"Cur Catoni de consilio nostro dixisti?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:132
translate latin a3s2_cfbd01f4:

    # "Alex echoes my sigh, looking away off to the side."
    "Alex suspiratum meum reddit, obtutu in latus averso."

# game/a3s2.rpy:133
translate latin a3s2_e08eb924:

    # al "\"I—there's a lot of {i}Galaxias{/i} politics that you wouldn't understand [mc]—\""
    al "\"Ego—multae res politicae {i}Galaxias{/i} sunt quas non intellegeres, [mc]—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:134
translate latin a3s2_10cf3c82:

    # m "\"Well, simplify it for me, then. I might be 'half-developed', but I think I'm starting to get the hang of how things work around here.\""
    m "\"Bene, simplicius mihi explica. Fortasse 'semiexcultus' sum, sed puto me intellegere incipere quomodo res hic agantur.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:135
translate latin a3s2_1e3ef232:

    # al "\"A—And if I tell you, you'll help me leave this cursed moon?\""
    al "\"E—et si tibi dico, me ex hac maledicta luna abire adiuvabis?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:136
translate latin a3s2_b9634b62:

    # "I grit my teeth."
    "Dentes comprimo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:137
translate latin a3s2_662f576d:

    # m "\"...Yes.\""
    m "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:138
translate latin a3s2_c9ec6347:

    # "Alex side-eyes me before shaking his head."
    "Alex a latere me spectat, deinde caput quatit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:139
translate latin a3s2_143be026:

    # al "\"I was...I became a pet for a single reason, not for ambassadorial, or Adastra-Omorfa relations...not even to gather intelligence—\""
    al "\"Eram...deliciae ob unam causam factus sum, non ad legationem aut necessitudines Adastrae et Omorfae...ne ad notitias quidem colligendas—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:140
translate latin a3s2_b17b4394:

    # al "\"I mean, originally that {i}was{/i} my purpose, but I became close to Cassius over the course of several official meetings and dinners.\""
    al "\"Dico, initio hoc propositum meum {i}erat{/i}; sed Cassio per aliquot conventus cenasque publicas familiaris factus sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:141
translate latin a3s2_724233aa:

    # al "\"My department took notice and...and altered my assignment.\""
    al "\"Administratio cui operam do id animadvertit et...et munus meum mutavit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:142
translate latin a3s2_3b04986a:

    # "The cat goes quiet again."
    "Felis rursus tacet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:143
translate latin a3s2_a14c428f:

    # m "\"Alright, then what are you here for now?\""
    m "\"Bene, ergo cur nunc hic es?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:144
translate latin a3s2_6a67dd63:

    # "Alex takes a deep breath and looks me in the eye."
    "Alex alte spirat et in oculos meos spectat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:146
translate latin a3s2_8d83c325:

    # al "\"Chaos.\""
    al "\"Chaos.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:147
translate latin a3s2_523b0150:

    # "I wait, but that's all the cat says."
    "Exspecto, sed hoc tantum felis dicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:148
translate latin a3s2_7b219b50:

    # "I frown at him."
    "Frontem ad eum corrugo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:149
translate latin a3s2_ffdf8af8:

    # m "\"You're...here to create chaos?\""
    m "\"Hic...es ut confusionem facias?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:150
translate latin a3s2_cab3a825:

    # "Alex's voice suddenly becomes monotonous."
    "Vox Alex subito aequa fit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:151
translate latin a3s2_06fb2a97:

    # al "\"An unstable government creates an unstable society.\""
    al "\"Regimen instabile societatem instabilem facit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:152
translate latin a3s2_f8d2684f:

    # al "\"Progress is stalled and outward endeavors turn inward. The society worries less about what is happening outside their borders while becoming more concerned with their own issues.\""
    al "\"Progressus sistitur et conatus externi intro vertuntur. Societas minus de rebus extra fines suos sollicitatur, magis de malis suis.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:153
translate latin a3s2_e049a2c4:

    # "It's like he's reciting something that he's heard many times before."
    "Quasi aliquid recitat quod saepe antea audivit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:154
translate latin a3s2_bcb6de31:

    # "Thinking about it, the explanation seems to have some reason to it."
    "Cum id considero, explicatio aliquam rationem habere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:155
translate latin a3s2_8410ec63:

    # "Alex's seemingly senseless decisions, shifting alliances, and general odd behavior could be explained by this."
    "Consilia Alex quae inania videbantur, foedera mutata et in universum miri mores sic explicari possint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:156
translate latin a3s2_774a1489:

    # "He's only here to make things more difficult for the wolves to integrate back into the {i}Galaxias{/i}."
    "Tantum hic est ut Lupis reditus in {i}Galaxias{/i} difficilior sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:157
translate latin a3s2_ddea01e4:

    # "To prevent them from progressing out of the technological and economic slump they're currently in."
    "Ut eos ex languore artis atque rei oeconomicae in quo nunc sunt progredi prohibeat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:158
translate latin a3s2_0c841c76:

    # "He's not just against me, Amicus, Cassius, or even Cato, but rather all of us at once."
    "Non tantum contra me, Amicum, Cassium aut etiam Catonem est, sed contra omnes nos simul."

# game/a3s2.rpy:159
translate latin a3s2_404cf934:

    # "I think about the billowing smoke over Adastra City, what's probably happening to dozens of cities right now, and I suddenly feel an overwhelming feeling of disgust for the cat in front of me."
    "De fumo supra Urbem Adastra volutante cogito, de iis quae fortasse nunc in compluribus duodenis urbibus fiant; subito ingens fastidium felis ante me stantis me pervadit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:160
translate latin a3s2_be47c7b4:

    # "A lot of things have happened on this moon that bothered me, but this particular act of sabotage is probably the worst."
    "Multae res in hac luna acciderunt quae me vexaverunt; sed hoc facinus subversionis fortasse pessimum est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:161
translate latin a3s2_677b3f44:

    # "Just something about how careless it is; not knowing what will even happen, just that it will hurt the empire, the people..."
    "Tanta eius neglegentia: ne scit quidem quid futurum sit, tantum imperium et populum laesum iri..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:162
translate latin a3s2_810561d5:

    # "Alex sees the look on my face and quickly takes a step back, looking away."
    "Alex vultum meum videt et cito recedit, obtutum avertens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:164
translate latin a3s2_2647b40c:

    # al "\"I understand that it may seem harsh, but it is my duty to Omorfa and the {i}Galaxias{/i} as a whole to keep us safe from Adastra. You...if you knew the history—\""
    al "\"Intellego id durum videri posse, sed officium meum Omorfae atque toti {i}Galaxias{/i} est nos ab Adastra incolumes servare. Tu...si historiam scires—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:165
translate latin a3s2_c377a3f9:

    # m "\"I assume you started the rumors about the triumvirates, then pinned it on me?\""
    m "\"Credo te rumores de triumviratibus excitavisse, deinde culpam mihi attribuisse?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:166
translate latin a3s2_720ccd1d:

    # al "\"I—I...I may have started the rumors, but I never implicated you.\""
    al "\"E—ego...Rumores fortasse excitavi, sed te numquam implicavi.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:167
translate latin a3s2_20152a99:

    # m "\"But you knew that would happen.\""
    m "\"Sed id futurum sciebas.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:169
translate latin a3s2_6039ec26:

    # "Alex opens his mouth, then shuts it, looking away again."
    "Alex os aperit, deinde claudit atque iterum oculos avertit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:170
translate latin a3s2_b0af2403:

    # m "\"And after I woke up in the gardens, told you about the doctor...you probably told Cato about our relationship then, too.\""
    m "\"Et postquam in hortis experrectus sum et de medico tibi narravi...tum quoque Catoni de amore nostro probabiliter dixisti.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:171
translate latin a3s2_7d3d6bc4:

    # "Alex frowns deeply, taking another step back, looking almost like a child that got caught doing something wrong."
    "Alex vehementer contrahit frontem et alterum gradum recedit, paene ut puer in maleficio deprehensus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:172
translate latin a3s2_0c51b4d9:

    # "I feel my face grow hot, not really confident anymore that I'll be able to hold myself back from caving this cat's face in."
    "Faciem meam incalescere sentio; iam haud confido me continere posse ne huius felis faciem pugnis conteram."

# game/a3s2.rpy:173
translate latin a3s2_027658fd:

    # "Maybe later...but this isn't important right now, even if this creature in front of me is responsible for half my troubles...if not all of them."
    "Fortasse postea...sed hoc nunc non refert, etiamsi hoc animal ante me causa est dimidiae partis aerumnarum mearum...si non omnium."

# game/a3s2.rpy:174
translate latin a3s2_f49d5750:

    # m "\"Where is Neferu, or Virginia?\""
    m "\"Ubi est Neferu aut Virginia?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:175
translate latin a3s2_58f10677:

    # "Alex looks surprised for a moment at the sudden shift in conversation."
    "Alex momento stupet quod sermo tam subito mutatus est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:177
translate latin a3s2_6d8e5927:

    # al "\"Well...Virginia is to be married to Cato later today—\""
    al "\"Bene...Virginia hodie serius Catoni nubit—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:178
translate latin a3s2_23d497b0:

    # "My stomach lurches at that, but before I can even start to comprehend what that means, Alex goes on."
    "Ad haec stomachus mihi perturbatur, sed antequam quid id significet comprehendere possim, Alex pergit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:179
translate latin a3s2_2e864f09:

    # al "\"As for Neferu, well...you don't know?\""
    al "\"Quod ad Neferu attinet...nescis?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:180
translate latin a3s2_b0b73cf7:

    # m "\"I've been locked in Amicus's room all day. I don't know anything.\""
    m "\"Totum diem in cubiculo Amici inclusus fui. Nihil scio.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:182
translate latin a3s2_e450bce4:

    # al "\"Ah well...Neferu is scheduled to be executed, I think...\""
    al "\"Ah...constitutum est ut Neferu supplicio afficiatur, credo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:183
translate latin a3s2_61f958ee:

    # "I stare."
    "Eum fixis oculis intueor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:184
translate latin a3s2_c58b903c:

    # m "\"What, when!?\""
    m "\"Quid? Quando!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:185
translate latin a3s2_69c6cd3a:

    # al "\"I—I'm not completely sure, I woke up alone in the dining room and saw it on the news channels.\""
    al "\"E—ego non plane certus sum; solus in triclinio experrectus sum idque in canalibus nuntiorum vidi.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:186
translate latin a3s2_f6b8c2db:

    # m "\"No, when is he being executed?\""
    m "\"Non, quando supplicio afficietur?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:187
translate latin a3s2_92130bdc:

    # al "\"I don't know...it was going to be sometime today.\""
    al "\"Nescio...hodie aliquando fieri debebat.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:188
translate latin a3s2_b31da6f2:

    # m "\"But it hasn't happened yet, right!?\""
    m "\"Sed nondum factum est, nonne!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:189
translate latin a3s2_f857b67c:

    # al "\"I—I—I don't kn—\""
    al "\"E—e—ego nes—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:190
translate latin a3s2_e51ada2b:

    # m "\"COM!\""
    m "\"COM!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:191
translate latin a3s2_2c106473:

    # "I cut Alex off, not caring anymore about alerting Com to my location."
    "Alex interrumpo, iam non curans an Com ubi sim certior fiat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:192
translate latin a3s2_80cf3baf:

    # com "\"Yes, [mc]?\""
    com "\"Ita, [mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:193
translate latin a3s2_40983d7c:

    # m "\"Has Neferu been executed?\""
    m "\"Neferu supplicio affectus est?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:194
translate latin a3s2_f85b39eb:

    # "There's a pause."
    "Paulisper tacet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:195
translate latin a3s2_1899e8fa:

    # "For a moment, all I can hear is my heartbeat hammering in my ears, and for a surreal moment, I feel like I'm going to pass out and I have to square my stance to make sure I don't go falling over."
    "Momentum nihil nisi cor in auribus meis vehementer pulsans audio; momento insolito deliquium me passurum sentio et firmiter consistendum est ne corruam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:196
translate latin a3s2_d23cf1a0:

    # "The pause seems longer than normal, like Com is having trouble finding the information that I asked for, then—"
    "Intervallum solito longius videtur, quasi Com informationem a me quaesitam difficulter inveniat, deinde—"

# game/a3s2.rpy:197
translate latin a3s2_8a2db982:

    # com "\"Here's what I found: The execution of Neferu, the Pharaoh's second son, is to take place in the royal amphitheater on the fourteenth hour for crimes of espionage and conspiracy to murder Emperor Cassius.\""
    com "\"Haec inveni: Neferu, secundus Pharaonis filius, hora quarta decima in amphitheatro regio supplicio afficietur ob explorationem clandestinam et coniurationem ad Imperatorem Cassium necandum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:198
translate latin a3s2_08902ebb:

    # com "\"The execution will be broadcast live on all public—\""
    com "\"Supplicium, dum fiet, transmittetur per omnes publicos—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:199
translate latin a3s2_28130a5b:

    # m "\"How much time until the fourteen hour!?\""
    m "\"Quantum temporis usque ad horam quartam decimam!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:200
translate latin a3s2_3c069ce5:

    # com "\"Fourteen minutes and thirty-one seconds.\""
    com "\"Quattuordecim minuta et triginta unum secunda.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:201
translate latin a3s2_d5af6f0b:

    # m "\"SHIT!\""
    m "\"MERDA!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:202
translate latin a3s2_4d988ae3:

    # "What the hell am I supposed to do?"
    "Quid, mehercule, facere debeo?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:203
translate latin a3s2_f4577c80:

    # "That's not enough time at all."
    "Id temporis omnino non sufficit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:204
translate latin a3s2_668d1a7e:

    # "Even if I can get to Amicus, I can't get him out in time before—\""
    "Etiamsi ad Amicum pervenire possim, eum tempore liberare non possum antequam—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:205
translate latin a3s2_c6594127:

    # mon "\"{cps=20}{i}...the cat...{/i}\""
    mon "\"{cps=20}{i}...felis...{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:206
translate latin a3s2_97c23fc1:

    # "I turn my eyes on Alex, and he immediately backs away again, trembling."
    "Oculos in Alex converto; statim iterum recedit tremens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:208
translate latin a3s2_c966f924:

    # m "\"Can you get Amicus out of the dungeons?\""
    m "\"Potesne Amicum e carceribus liberare?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:209
translate latin a3s2_b61e2ccf:

    # al "\"I—I—\""
    al "\"E—ego—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:210
translate latin a3s2_e3f2572c:

    # "In that moment I almost slap him, but I stubbornly force my shaking hands to stay at my sides."
    "Eo momento eum paene alapa ferio, sed pertinaciter manus tremulas ad latera retinere me cogo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:211
translate latin a3s2_04306acf:

    # m "\"Can you fucking get him out, or not?\""
    m "\"Potesne, mehercule, eum liberare an non?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:213
translate latin a3s2_4ce1a903:

    # al "\"I...think so. Cassius gave me almost unlimited access to Com's security—\""
    al "\"Ego...credo. Cassius mihi potestatem paene infinitam dedit ad securitatem Com administrandam—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:214
translate latin a3s2_e0aa8397:

    # "My heart leaps in my chest."
    "Cor in pectore mihi exsilit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:215
translate latin a3s2_e04afe8e:

    # m "\"Then let's go down there and get him the hell out.\""
    m "\"Tum descendamus eumque inde, mehercule, liberemus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:216
translate latin a3s2_4ab29769:

    # "I turn to the door, but notice Alex is still frozen in the same place."
    "Ad ianuam me verto, sed Alex eodem loco adhuc immobilem animadverto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:217
translate latin a3s2_244bb5cf:

    # "The look on my face makes him cringe again."
    "Vultus meus eum iterum reformidare facit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:218
translate latin a3s2_c2b14ef7:

    # al "\"Y—yes, but...you won't let him imprison, or execute me if I do?\""
    al "\"I—ita, sed...non sines eum me in carcerem conicere aut supplicio afficere, si id faciam?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:219
translate latin a3s2_14d2f43a:

    # m "\"Alex...{i}I{/i} will kill you right now if you don't fucking do what I tell you!\""
    m "\"Alex...{i}ego{/i} te statim necabo nisi, mehercule, facis quod tibi dico!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:221
translate latin a3s2_75130942:

    # "The cat jumps and yelps as I scream at him, scrambling to head out the door with me hot on his heels."
    "Felis exsilit atque eiulat dum ei inclamo; festinans ianuam exit, me vestigiis eius instante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:223
translate latin a3s2_87e55253:

    # "The cat was at least right about one thing:"
    "Saltem in una re felis recte dixit:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:224
translate latin a3s2_1cf0169f:

    # "I would never be able to be a \"diplomat\" if that's what he really is."
    "Numquam \"legatus\" esse possem, si id revera est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:227
translate latin a3s2_a6d066fc:

    # "I follow as closely to the cat as possible, practically stepping on his heels."
    "Felem quam proxime sequor, paene eius calcibus insistens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:228
translate latin a3s2_c0212502:

    # "Alex is clearly aware of it as his ears twitch back and forth nervously, trying to inconspicuously glance back at me every now and then."
    "Alex id plane sentit: aures nervose ultro citroque movet, identidem furtim ad me respicere conans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:229
translate latin a3s2_c8451925:

    # "Halfway to the dungeons though, the PSA system crackles over our heads."
    "Sed medio itinere ad carceres systema nuntiorum publicorum supra capita nostra crepitat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:230
translate latin a3s2_da77757e:

    # com "\"Citizens of Adastra; please prepare for an imperial address by Emperor Cato.\""
    com "\"Cives Adastrae, vos quaeso parate ad orationem imperialem Imperatoris Catonis.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:231
translate latin a3s2_bbd5ce9a:

    # "Alex looks back, but I force him to keep going with some prodding in his back, praying that maybe this won't have to do with the execution, or that Cato might be canceling it all together."
    "Alex respicit, sed eum dorso pulsando pergere cogo, precans ut haec fortasse ad supplicium non pertineant aut Cato id omnino rescindat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:232
translate latin a3s2_c9f4c331:

    # "Of course, that's not the case."
    "Scilicet res aliter se habet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:233
translate latin a3s2_4797ebe1:

    # ca "\"Citizens, it is a momentous day in the long history of our glorious moon.\""
    ca "\"Cives, hic dies magni momenti est in longa historia gloriosae lunae nostrae.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:234
translate latin a3s2_9282a4d5:

    # "I shove at Alex's back again."
    "Dorsum Alex iterum impello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:235
translate latin a3s2_b0eaf731:

    # m "\"Just run.\""
    m "\"Curre tantum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:236
translate latin a3s2_be1a7434:

    # "Alex does as he's told, though it's still not as fast as I'd like to go."
    "Alex imperato paret, quamquam ne ita quidem tam celeriter it quam velim."

# game/a3s2.rpy:237
translate latin a3s2_94d6b49d:

    # ca "\"After 10,000 years, we are finally choosing our own path, we are taking control of our destiny.\""
    ca "\"Post decem milia annorum tandem viam nostram eligimus, fatum nostrum in potestatem nostram redigimus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:238
translate latin a3s2_86a6bfd9:

    # "I'm beginning to realize that after waiting for so long, unsure of what my own destiny might be..."
    "Intellegere incipio, postquam tam diu exspectavi, incertus quid fatum meum futurum esset..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:239
translate latin a3s2_dcd401e7:

    # "...It's going to be decided today, no matter what the outcome might be."
    "...hodie id decernetur, quicumque exitus erit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:240
translate latin a3s2_f67941bd:

    # ca "\"And that begins with showing our fellow siblings that we will no longer tolerate their belittling, their false sense of superiority, their arrogance...\""
    ca "\"Id autem incipit ostendendo Fratribus nostris nos iam non toleraturos esse contemptum eorum, inanem opinionem se superiores esse, superbiam eorum...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:241
translate latin a3s2_20b2dfa5:

    # "Alex and I come up on the door that leads down to the dungeon and the cat awkwardly starts climbing down the ladder, having a great deal of trouble with his robes."
    "Alex et ego ad ianuam carcerum pervenimus; felis ineleganter per scalam descendere incipit, vestibus suis valde impeditus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:242
translate latin a3s2_d86acbfb:

    # ca "\"...and we especially will not tolerate spies, which I have kneeling before me as I speak.\""
    ca "\"...praesertim autem exploratores non tolerabimus, quos dum loquor ante me genuflexos habeo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:243
translate latin a3s2_e702aa93:

    # m "\"Hurry!\""
    m "\"Festina!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:244
translate latin a3s2_0544400d:

    # "I yell at the cat as I start sliding down the ladder myself, almost knocking him off as we reach the ground at almost the same time."
    "Feli inclamo dum ipse per scalam delabor; eum paene deicio, cum terram paene simul tangimus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:245
translate latin a3s2_71b36a99:

    # ca "\"The Offerer of False Alliances, The Whore of Jackals, The Flower of Khemia...\""
    ca "\"Falsarum Societatum Promissor, Chacalorum Scortum, Flos Khemiae...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:247
translate latin a3s2_41183a46:

    # "I follow the stumbling cat through the musty hall of the dungeon, never having been in this deep before considering my meetings with Amicus had to take place near the entrance."
    "Felem titubantem per mucidum carceris andronem sequor; numquam tam penitus intravi, quoniam congressus mei cum Amico prope ingressum habendi erant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:248
translate latin a3s2_4505f7e7:

    # "We reach a cell door, and Alex presses a paw to a panel on the wall; a beige, marble slab rather than the more glossy, black panels above."
    "Ad ianuam cellae pervenimus; Alex manum tabulae parietis admovet, marmoreo lapidi pallide fusco, pro tabulis nigris nitidioribus quae supra sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:251
translate latin a3s2_995121a5:

    # "It opens to a small, cramped cell; a bed in one corner, a sink, toilet, and tiny shower in another, and what looks like a desk near the door."
    "Aperitur cella parva et angusta: lectus in uno angulo, pelvis, latrina et minima lavatio pluvialis in altero, et quod mensa scriptoria videtur prope ianuam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:252
translate latin a3s2_159ba207:

    # "Amicus is in the bed, curled up on his side, facing away from us."
    "Amicus in lecto iacet, in latus contractus, facie a nobis aversa."

# game/a3s2.rpy:253
translate latin a3s2_0c416389:

    # m "\"Amicus!\""
    m "\"Amice!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:254
translate latin a3s2_7b71801e:

    # "I shove roughly past Alex, sending him to smack face-first against the doorframe with a yelp."
    "Dure praeter Alex irrumpo et eum vultu primum in postem ianuae impingo; ille eiulat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:255
translate latin a3s2_266e20f7:

    # "The big wolf starts to stir before I reach him and throw my arms over him."
    "Magnus lupus moveri incipit antequam ad eum pervenio atque brachiis eum complector."

# game/a3s2.rpy:256
translate latin a3s2_81877ec5:

    # "I feel him jump underneath me, and I know I've just woken him up."
    "Eum sub me exsilire sentio scioque me modo eum excitavisse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:257
translate latin a3s2_50118255:

    # "He turns his head to look at me."
    "Caput vertit ut me aspiciat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:259
translate latin a3s2_804cd142:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:260
translate latin a3s2_8cccba06:

    # "He sits up against my hugging, automatically wrapping his arms around me."
    "Quamvis eum amplectar, se erigit atque sua sponte brachia mihi circumdat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:261
translate latin a3s2_83189111:

    # a "\"Wait, how did you—\""
    a "\"Exspecta, quomodo tu—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:262
translate latin a3s2_21e22be7:

    # "He looks over my shoulder."
    "Ultra umerum meum aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:263
translate latin a3s2_b5fa7963:

    # a "\"Alex?\""
    a "\"Alex?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:264
translate latin a3s2_efb11699:

    # m "\"Amicus! Cato is emperor, he's about to execute Neferu, you need to—\""
    m "\"Amice! Cato imperator est, Neferu iam iam supplicio afficiet; debes—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:265
translate latin a3s2_f23bb97a:

    # "I choke on my words, only now feeling the weight of the information I'm just dropping on Amicus right now."
    "Verba faucibus haerent; nunc demum pondus nuntiorum sentio quos hoc ipso momento Amico impono."

# game/a3s2.rpy:266
translate latin a3s2_e77f77ce:

    # m "\"—you need to challenge him to combat.\""
    m "\"—debes eum ad pugnam provocare.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:267
translate latin a3s2_edda0881:

    # "I surprise myself as I suddenly start to cry, realizing my own words as I say them."
    "Me ipse miror cum subito flere incipio, verba mea dum pronuntio intellegens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:268
translate latin a3s2_d57a462c:

    # "In that moment, I can see all the confusion, bewilderment, and shock in my wolf's face, his mouth hanging open just slightly."
    "Eo momento omnem confusionem, perturbationem et stuporem in vultu lupi mei video; os eius paululum apertum manet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:269
translate latin a3s2_593b2212:

    # "He probably wants to ask me a million questions, but in that space of a few seconds, I see his expression set into one of serious determination."
    "Milies me rogare fortasse vult, sed intra pauca secunda vultum eius in gravem constantiam mutari video."

# game/a3s2.rpy:271
translate latin a3s2_09a1342d:

    # a "\"Alright. Where is he?\""
    a "\"Bene. Ubi est?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:272
translate latin a3s2_234acae2:

    # "The sudden shift from confusion to a sense of duty and confidence actually stops my crying, even as the first tears spill over."
    "Subita mutatio a confusione ad officium et fiduciam fletum meum sistit, etsi primae lacrimae effluunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:273
translate latin a3s2_5547f7e4:

    # m "\"The—the amphitheater, it's happening right now."
    m "\"In—in amphitheatro; hoc ipso momento fit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:275
translate latin a3s2_9b471f43:

    # "For just a moment, the wolf continues to hold me, wipes a tear away with his thumb, then gently moves me aside as he swings his legs over the edge of the bed."
    "Lupus me paulisper adhuc tenet, lacrimam pollice abstergit, deinde leniter me removet dum crura ultra marginem lecti mittit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:277
translate latin a3s2_2049e238:

    # a "\"Alex, can I leave the dungeon?\""
    a "\"Alex, possumne carcerem relinquere?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:279
translate latin a3s2_a0d2b4d2:

    # al "\"Um...Com...let Amicus leave the dungeons...please?\""
    al "\"Em...Com...sine Amicum carceres relinquere...quaeso?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:280
translate latin a3s2_fea2c737:

    # "Alex looks up at the ceiling, clearly unsure of what he's doing."
    "Alex ad tectum aspicit, plane incertus quid faciat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:281
translate latin a3s2_3730bbae:

    # com "\"Shall I remove Amicus from the prisoner list, Alex?\""
    com "\"Amicum e catalogo captivorum removeam, Alex?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:282
translate latin a3s2_0c8b9bfb:

    # al "\"Uh...yes.\""
    al "\"Ah...ita.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:283
translate latin a3s2_bd864ece:

    # com "\"It is done.\""
    com "\"Factum est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:284
translate latin a3s2_8292f83e:

    # "At that moment, I suddenly realize then that Cato isn't being broadcast down here."
    "Eo momento subito animadverto orationem Catonis huc non transmitti."

# game/a3s2.rpy:285
translate latin a3s2_363658d3:

    # "I don't even know if the execution has been carried out yet or not."
    "Ne scio quidem an supplicium iam sumptum sit necne."

# game/a3s2.rpy:286
translate latin a3s2_ff77a760:

    # "Amicus hops off the bed."
    "Amicus e lecto desilit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:287
translate latin a3s2_ed4fa451:

    # a "\"Alright, we must move!\""
    a "\"Bene, eundum est!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:291
translate latin a3s2_698e87b1:

    # "This time, Alex is knocked on his ass as Amicus practically steamrolls him on his way out the door."
    "Hoc tempore Alex in nates deicitur, dum Amicus eum paene proterens ianuam exit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:292
translate latin a3s2_5721aee3:

    # "I jump over the cat as I follow the wolf."
    "Felem transilio dum lupum sequor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:293
translate latin a3s2_eb94c7d5:

    # "Though much bigger, Amicus is still just slightly faster than I am as I sprint after him, his thundering footfalls echoing through the halls."
    "Quamquam multo maior est, Amicus adhuc paulo me velocior est; post eum curro, pedum eius fragore per andrones resonante."

# game/a3s2.rpy:294
translate latin a3s2_c19c2800:

    # "He yells back at me as I follow."
    "Me sequente ad me retro clamat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:295
translate latin a3s2_08bd6497:

    # a "\"What of Cassius!?\""
    a "\"Quid de Cassio!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:296
translate latin a3s2_d3df92d3:

    # m "\"Poisoned! He's...I don't know what his condition is right now!\""
    m "\"Veneno affectus! Ille...nescio quo statu nunc sit!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:297
translate latin a3s2_2ab864d8:

    # "I gasp out the answer and I can't see his face as Amicus is silent, continuing to run."
    "Responsum anhelans dico; vultum eius videre non possum, dum Amicus tacitus currere pergit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:298
translate latin a3s2_19e9c823:

    # "We reach the ladder and Amicus somehow climbs the thing with three gigantic lunges, skipping several rungs at a time."
    "Ad scalam pervenimus; Amicus tribus ingentibus saltibus eam ascendit, plures gradus unoquoque saltu omittens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:299
translate latin a3s2_5a6509c2:

    # "By the time I reach the top, he's already out of sight."
    "Cum summum attingo, iam e conspectu abiit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:301
translate latin a3s2_3096afa9:

    # ca "\"So now, let this be a warning to Khemia, or any other sibling race...\""
    ca "\"Hoc igitur nunc Khemiae aut cuique alii genti Fratrum monimento sit...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:303
translate latin a3s2_519b54b4:

    # "I run out into the gardens, in the direction of the amphitheater."
    "In hortos excurro ad amphitheatrum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:304
translate latin a3s2_8fe5b8b1:

    # "I just catch sight of Amicus's tail as it disappears around some trees, down the trail that leads to where Cato should be."
    "Caudam Amici vix conspicio dum post arbores evanescit, per semitam quae eo ducit ubi Cato esse debet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:305
translate latin a3s2_9c601979:

    # ca "\"We will not hesitate to eliminate you if you meddle in our matters!\""
    ca "\"Vos exstinguere non dubitabimus, si rebus nostris vos immiscetis!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:306
translate latin a3s2_6ab9e98c:

    # "There's a sense of finality to those words, and I know that we're out of time."
    "In illis verbis quiddam extremum inest; scio tempus nostrum exhaustum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:307
translate latin a3s2_0a423a18:

    # "I'm on the path to the amphitheater, and though it only takes a few seconds to make it to the end, it feels like an eternity."
    "Per semitam ad amphitheatrum curro; quamquam ad eius finem pervenire pauca secunda tantum postulat, aeternitas mihi videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:308
translate latin a3s2_13c0da5f:

    # mon "\"{cps=20}{i}You are on the right path...{/i}\""
    mon "\"{cps=20}{i}Rectam viam sequeris...{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:310
translate latin a3s2_f795555d:

    # "I burst through into the clearing of the amphitheater just as I hear Amicus yell."
    "In apertum amphitheatri spatium irrumpo ipso momento quo Amicum clamantem audio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:311
translate latin a3s2_040a7580:

    # a "\"STOP!\""
    a "\"SISTE!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:313
translate latin a3s2_1a95f15c:

    # "I look down the steps to see my wolf standing at the base of the stairs, his paws out wide, standing in front of Neferu and Cato."
    "Per gradus deorsum aspicio et lupum meum ad imas scalas stantem video, manibus late distentis, ante Neferu et Catonem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:314
translate latin a3s2_bf6e645d:

    # "The jackal is knelt on the ground, his paws restrained behind his back somehow, a look of dazed, disbelief on his face."
    "Chacalus in terra genua flectit, manibus nescio quo modo post tergum vinctis, vultu attonito et incredulo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:315
translate latin a3s2_c680dce3:

    # "His face is forced to look up because Cato has a hold of his head fur, tilting the jackal's head up so that his neck is fully exposed."
    "Facies eius sursum spectare cogitur, quia Cato pilos capitis tenet atque caput chacali reclinat ut collum omnino pateat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:316
translate latin a3s2_33718240:

    # "In Cato's other massive paw is a shiny, gold, decorative dagger, and it's just inches away from Neferu's neck."
    "In altera ingenti manu Catonis fulget pugio aureus ornatus, a collo Neferu paucos pollices distans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:317
translate latin a3s2_6c7a435c:

    # "Meanwhile, directly across from me, sitting in front of the statue of Drusus sits Virginia, a wreathe of flowers on her head, looking shocked as she stares at her brother."
    "Interim Virginia recta ex altera parte contra me ante statuam Drusi sedet, floribus coronata, fratrem suum stupens intuetur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:319
translate latin a3s2_85a2f236:

    # a "\"I challenge you Cato! I challenge you to a trial by combat for the throne, as is my birthright!\""
    a "\"Te provoco, Cato! Ad iudicium per pugnam de solio te provoco, ut iure natalium mihi licet!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:321
translate latin a3s2_3ec7db84:

    # "It's always hard to judge Cato's facial expressions, but I can see the tightness in his jaw all the way from up here."
    "Semper difficile est vultum Catonis interpretari; sed etiam hinc desuper maxillam eius contractam video."

# game/a3s2.rpy:322
translate latin a3s2_4765eae1:

    # ca "\"Who...\""
    ca "\"Quis...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:323
translate latin a3s2_5bc132dd:

    # "Cato glances upward, and for a moment I wonder if somehow he knows I'm there, that he can see me."
    "Cato sursum aspicit; momento miror an nescio quo modo me adesse sciat, an me videre possit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:324
translate latin a3s2_bb3b17cf:

    # "But then I notice the camera drones hovering overhead, broadcasting this to all of Adastra."
    "Tum autem automata volatilia cum cameris supra caput suspensa animadverto, haec toti Adastrae transmittentia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:325
translate latin a3s2_6501c758:

    # "The entire empire is seeing this."
    "Totum imperium hoc videt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:327
translate latin a3s2_b4cc2d78:

    # ca "\"Why...don't we wait until this is finished, Amicus?\""
    ca "\"Cur...non exspectamus dum hoc confectum sit, Amice?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:329
translate latin a3s2_11419bd2:

    # a "\"It would be wise to stay your paw, Cato...unless you're afraid you'll lose the trial?\""
    a "\"Manum continere sapienter facias, Cato...nisi te in certamine victum iri times?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:331
translate latin a3s2_697df0a1:

    # "The corner of Cato's scarred eye twitches."
    "Angulus oculi Catonis cicatrice deformati tremit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:332
translate latin a3s2_43f9279d:

    # "I can tell then that Amicus is playing this all up to the cameras, and that seems to settle it for Cato."
    "Tum intellego Amicum omnia haec ad cameras agere; hac re Cato decernere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:333
translate latin a3s2_dcf80945:

    # "With a grunt, he pulls Neferu up to his feet by his head fur, making the jackal wince before shoving him toward the front seat where Neferu slumps down."
    "Cum gemitu Neferu pilis capitis in pedes trahit, chacalum dolore vultum contrahere cogens, deinde eum ad primum sedile impellit, in quod Neferu collabitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:334
translate latin a3s2_d61475ee:

    # "Then, the old wolf walks past Amicus, setting the dagger down on the long, curved bench as well, across the aisle from Neferu."
    "Tum senex lupus praeter Amicum ambulat atque pugionem in longo curvato subsellio deponit, ex altera parte viae inter sedilia, contra Neferu."

# game/a3s2.rpy:336
translate latin a3s2_e1867179:

    # ca "\"You know what, Amicus? I think you're right. This is something we should do immediately. We don't want to leave the empire in limbo for any longer, do we?\""
    ca "\"Scis quid, Amice? Recte dicere te puto. Hoc statim facere debemus. Imperium diutius in incerto relinquere nolumus, vero?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:337
translate latin a3s2_18d19803:

    # "Amicus watches the other wolf wearily as he walks around him to stand in the center of the amphitheater."
    "Amicus alterum lupum caute observat dum ille circa eum ambulat ut in medio amphitheatro consistat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:338
translate latin a3s2_eb99deb2:

    # ca "\"It's best to settle...everything, as soon as possible.\""
    ca "\"Optimum est...omnia quam primum dirimere.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:339
translate latin a3s2_31e06a92:

    # "I know that Cato is referring to all of us...Cassius, Virginia, Neferu, me...and I'm sure Amicus does too, because he glances back up at me for just a moment."
    "Scio Catonem de nobis omnibus loqui...Cassio, Virginia, Neferu, me...et Amicum quoque scire certo credo, quia momento ad me sursum respicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:341
translate latin a3s2_b635ede9:

    # a "\"Then let us settle it!\""
    a "\"Tum dirimamus!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:342
translate latin a3s2_48429b80:

    # "Slowly, I start to make my way down the steps, glancing over at Virginia to see that she's sitting up completely straight, staring at Cato and Amicus, her paws clenched in her lap."
    "Lente per gradus descendere incipio, ad Virginiam aspiciens: plane erecta sedet, Catonem et Amicum intuens, manibus in gremio constrictis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:343
translate latin a3s2_e9bd6bb4:

    # "I move toward Neferu who's sitting on the front bench, hunched over a bit, and I can see metal glinting where his arms are held back."
    "Ad Neferu in primo subsellio paulum incurvatum accedo; metallum fulgere video ubi brachia eius post tergum retinentur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:344
translate latin a3s2_af26870c:

    # ca "\"Alright then, trial by combat, simple {i}pugnu{/i} with no weapons...just teeth and claws.\""
    ca "\"Bene igitur, iudicium per pugnam, simplex {i}pugnu{/i} sine armis...dentibus tantum et unguibus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:345
translate latin a3s2_1c62e3cc:

    # "Cato stretches."
    "Cato membra extendit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:346
translate latin a3s2_e9492ad2:

    # ca "\"I'll give you the advantage of sight, Amicus. This should be no trouble for you at all, eh?\""
    ca "\"Commodum visus tibi concedam, Amice. Hoc tibi nullo modo difficile esse debet, eh?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:347
translate latin a3s2_6f4cb6a4:

    # "Even though that's true, Cato still seems very, very confident."
    "Quamquam hoc verum est, Cato tamen sibi valde, valde confidere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:348
translate latin a3s2_766c7e83:

    # "And he has every right to be considering his skill at fighting along with the fact that Amicus has been locked up for several days in a cramped cell."
    "Neque iniuria, cum tam peritus pugnae sit et Amicus per complures dies in angusta cella inclusus fuerit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:349
translate latin a3s2_220ad70f:

    # "He probably only said that to increase the humiliation if Amicus loses...if he dies."
    "Id probabiliter dixit tantum ut dedecus augeret si Amicus vincatur...si moriatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:350
translate latin a3s2_2668d144:

    # "It's then that I start to feel the dread and terror begin to poke through the numbed shock I've been feeling."
    "Tum metum atque terrorem per stuporem torpidum, quem sentiebam, emergere sentio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:351
translate latin a3s2_2607f720:

    # "But somehow, Amicus looks completely calm, and I take some sort of comfort in that."
    "Sed Amicus nescio quo modo omnino tranquillus videtur, ex quo aliquod solacium capio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:355
translate latin a3s2_ff578a12:

    # "Quietly, I sit down next to Neferu and he glances over at me."
    "Tacitus iuxta Neferu consido; ille ad me aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:357
translate latin a3s2_c3bb8be6:

    # n "\"Oh, [mc], what brings you here?\""
    n "\"Oh, [mc], quid te huc adducit?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:358
translate latin a3s2_8e7c88c7:

    # "Though his words are casual, his usual smug demeanor is gone, practically blanked out as he sits there, slightly hunched."
    "Quamquam verba eius neglegentia sunt, consueta arrogantia evanuit; paene vacuus videtur dum ibi paulum incurvatus sedet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:359
translate latin a3s2_994f6c7b:

    # m "\"Are you okay?\""
    m "\"Vales?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:360
translate latin a3s2_b3cc2f27:

    # "I whisper to him, and Neferu takes that as his cue to do so as well."
    "Ei susurro; Neferu intellegit sibi quoque susurrandum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:361
translate latin a3s2_b72e71fd:

    # "The jackal shrugs his shoulders."
    "Chacalus umeros tollit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:362
translate latin a3s2_44ac0bea:

    # n "\"Not exactly, no, but I'm alive for the time being, so I suppose I can't ask for much more.\""
    n "\"Non prorsus, non; sed adhuc vivo, itaque multo plus petere vix possum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:364
translate latin a3s2_e7b37b32:

    # "I look back into the amphitheater, wishing that I were able to do something more."
    "In amphitheatrum respicio, cupiens ut amplius aliquid facere possem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:365
translate latin a3s2_79be8d1f:

    # "I try to catch Amicus's eye, but he keeps his focus on Cato, his own eyes narrowed."
    "Oculos Amici ad me convertere conor, sed in Catonem animum intentum retinet, oculis contractis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:366
translate latin a3s2_ccbbe45b:

    # "He looks confident, prepared, ready for whatever it is that Cato throws at him."
    "Confidens, paratus videtur, ad quidquid Cato adversus eum faciat promptus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:367
translate latin a3s2_2bf35716:

    # "But I'm not ready."
    "Sed ego paratus non sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:368
translate latin a3s2_2072d506:

    # "I'm not ready at all."
    "Omnino paratus non sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:369
translate latin a3s2_458031dd:

    # "That brief interaction in the dungeon, those few seconds of holding on to one another."
    "Ille brevis congressus in carcere, illa pauca secunda quibus alter alterum tenebamus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:370
translate latin a3s2_16a4bcc7:

    # "That could be the last time we ever—"
    "Illud ultimum tempus esse potest quo nos umquam—"

# game/a3s2.rpy:371
translate latin a3s2_462cf016:

    # "I blink back tears again, knowing that won't do me any good right now."
    "Lacrimas iterum palpebris reprimo, sciens eas mihi nunc nihil profuturas esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:372
translate latin a3s2_a79d5dfb:

    # ca "\"Are you ready, Amicus?\""
    ca "\"Paratus es, Amice?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:373
translate latin a3s2_bcc81977:

    # a "\"Yes.\""
    a "\"Ita.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:374
translate latin a3s2_10f035b1:

    # ca "\"Then let us begin.\""
    ca "\"Tum incipiamus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:377
translate latin a3s2_b677edf9:

    # "Immediately, the two wolves begin to circle each other, paws raised up to their chests, open and ready."
    "Statim duo lupi alter alterum circumire incipiunt, manibus ad pectus sublatis, apertis et paratis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:378
translate latin a3s2_a06a9c3e:

    # "The only difference from past {i}pugnu{/i} fights I've seen is that they're both baring their teeth."
    "Hoc solum ab prioribus certaminibus {i}pugnu{/i} quae vidi differt: ambo dentes nudant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:379
translate latin a3s2_d95af87d:

    # "Amicus does it in a way that I've never seen before, not even when he was furious."
    "Amicus id facit modo quem numquam antea vidi, ne cum furiosus quidem erat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:380
translate latin a3s2_26fac2e9:

    # "It's vicious, feral, like I've seen wolves do in nature documentaries."
    "Atrox est et ferinus, sicut lupos in pelliculis de natura facere vidi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:381
translate latin a3s2_b2598706:

    # "Then, they clash."
    "Tum concurrunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:382
translate latin a3s2_5a68a795:

    # "It's so fast that I'm not able to tell who moved first, but one moment they're several feet apart and the next, their paws are clasped together while their jaws snap in the air, both going for the other's throat."
    "Tam cito fit ut quis prior motus sit discernere non possim; momento pluribus pedibus distant, proximo manus inter se premunt dum fauces in aere mordent, uterque alterius gulam petens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:383
translate latin a3s2_571b7a09:

    # "Glistening strands of saliva go flying as they both bite and block with their teeth, ears pinned back, making hoarse, angry barking and growling sounds."
    "Fila salivae nitentia evolant dum ambo mordent et dentibus ictus prohibent, auribus retro depressis, latratus et fremitus raucos iratosque edentes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:384
translate latin a3s2_a4a07c26:

    # "It's something I've never seen an Adastran wolf do, not even in their fake dramas."
    "Id lupum Adastranum numquam facere vidi, ne in fabulis fictis quidem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:385
translate latin a3s2_8240bdf7:

    # "This feels raw and instinctual, like it's a part of them, something they try to conceal, only to come up to the surface when they're trying to kill."
    "Hoc crudum et instinctu motum videtur, quasi pars eorum sit, aliquid quod celare conantur et quod tantum cum necare conantur emergit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:386
translate latin a3s2_0cbef590:

    # "I find myself hugging my chest, feeling as if my heart might explode as I watch Amicus, trying to see if he's hurt, wincing every time I hear the solid {i}thwock{/i} of teeth on teeth."
    "Pectus meum amplecti me invenio, quasi cor mihi rumpi possit dum Amicum observo, conans videre an laesus sit, vultum contrahens quoties solidum dentium inter se collidentium {i}crepitum{/i} audio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:387
translate latin a3s2_a8be5033:

    # "It might only have lasted a few seconds, I can't tell, but finally Amicus pulls back and Cato suddenly lunges in for the other wolf's neck."
    "Pauca secunda tantum fortasse duravit, discernere nequeo; tandem Amicus recedit et Cato subito ad collum alterius lupi impetum facit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:388
translate latin a3s2_e611fe33:

    # "Time seems to slow, and for a moment I start to think about what I'm going to do if I lose him..."
    "Tempus tardius fluere videtur; momento cogitare incipio quid facturus sim si eum amittam..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:389
translate latin a3s2_943bea2f:

    # "...but then Cato's open, fang-filled maw drops down and so does the rest of him as Amicus sweeps his legs with a powerful kick."
    "...sed tum fauces Catonis patentes, dentibus acutis plenae, deorsum cadunt atque reliquum corpus quoque, dum Amicus valida calce eius crura subducit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:390
translate latin a3s2_7f9e8a8c:

    # "Cato goes down hard on his side right in front of me, wheezing before Amicus jumps on him, landing on the older wolf with his knees and a fist to the face."
    "Cato in latus graviter cadit recta ante me, anhelans, antequam Amicus in eum insilit, genibus in seniorem lupum et pugno in faciem impactis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:391
translate latin a3s2_ccd25cc4:

    # "Cato doesn't even seem to notice that though as he immediately grabs on to Amicus, their paws scrabbling at each other as they both try to find a hold."
    "Cato id ne animadvertere quidem videtur: statim Amicum prehendit. Ambo celeriter manus per alterius corpus movent, conantes invenire ubi firmiter prehendere possint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:392
translate latin a3s2_2b487741:

    # "They're at a stalemate for a while, each one failing to find a good grip as they both twist and turn over each other, making snarling sounds all the while."
    "Aliquamdiu aequis viribus haerent, uterque firmiter prehendere non valens dum inter se torquentur et volvuntur, perpetuo fremitus edentes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:393
translate latin a3s2_aa569c7d:

    # "At some points, I have trouble discerning the two, their legs and arms seeming to blend together as they grip around the other's body."
    "Interdum ambos discernere difficulter possum; crura et brachia eorum misceri videntur dum corpus alterius amplectuntur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:394
translate latin a3s2_51a9f722:

    # "I was never told much about combat to the death, even when I asked Neferu."
    "De pugna ad mortem mihi numquam multa narrata sunt, ne cum Neferu quidem interrogavi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:395
translate latin a3s2_d27a3e32:

    # "All I know is that they tend to be very short, but it's already felt like an eternity."
    "Hoc tantum scio: plerumque brevissimae sunt; sed iam aeternitas mihi visa est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:396
translate latin a3s2_201ec85f:

    # "Suddenly, I am able to tell them apart as Cato locks Amicus's right arm into a shoulder lock."
    "Subito eos discernere possum, cum Cato brachium dextrum Amici vinculo umeri immobilizat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:397
translate latin a3s2_8ca9c282:

    # "While I've seen it done before, usually to get the other opponent to tap out, Cato immediately goes all the way and the quiet of the early evening is shattered with a massive pop and crunching sound."
    "Quamquam id antea vidi, plerumque ut adversarius pulsando cederet, Cato statim ad extremum procedit; silentium primae vesperae ingenti crepitu fragoreque frangitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:398
translate latin a3s2_87c0b1e1:

    # "Amicus screams, and I find myself standing without even realizing it."
    "Amicus clamat; stantem me invenio, ne animadvertens quidem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:399
translate latin a3s2_3747949f:

    # "It takes everything I have not to jump in right now, even as Cato leans into the hold, causing Amicus to convulse from the pain."
    "Totis viribus me contineo ne statim in pugnam insiliam, etiam dum Cato in complexum suum magis incumbit atque Amicum dolore convelli facit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:400
translate latin a3s2_0aba1df0:

    # "Then Cato lets go and my wolf curls over onto his side, shaking violently, loosely holding his arm with his other paw."
    "Tum Cato eum dimittit et lupus meus in latus contrahitur, vehementer tremens, altera manu brachium laxe tenens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:401
translate latin a3s2_fb6b3f6e:

    # "I want to go to him, but Cato is already there, pushing the younger wolf over onto his back."
    "Ad eum ire volo, sed Cato iam adest, lupum iuniorem supinum vertens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:402
translate latin a3s2_162f4b5a:

    # ca "\"I should have done this a long time ago, pup.\""
    ca "\"Hoc iam pridem facere debui, catule.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:403
translate latin a3s2_1e64d384:

    # "I knew this would happen."
    "Hoc futurum sciebam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:404
translate latin a3s2_73f69bbf:

    # "Amicus tries to fight back with his good arm, even his legs, trying to lock his ankles around Cato's neck, but the old wolf straddles Amicus's waist before slamming a fist hard into his nose."
    "Amicus brachio sano, immo cruribus quoque, repugnare conatur, talos circa collum Catonis nectere temptans; sed senex lupus cruribus divaricatis lumbis Amici insidet, deinde nasum eius graviter pugno ferit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:405
translate latin a3s2_4379cbfa:

    # "There's a softer crunching sound this time, and Amicus immediately goes limp, eyes vacant, paw falling to his side."
    "Hoc tempore mollior fragor auditur; Amicus statim flaccidus fit, oculis vacuis, manu ad latus cadente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:406
translate latin a3s2_386e9586:

    # "I knew Cato was too skilled for Amicus, but for some reason I thought..."
    "Sciebam Catonem Amico multo peritiorem esse, sed nescio cur putabam..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:408
translate latin a3s2_be4f3ca5:

    # mon "\"{i}These are the events that shall happen. You are on the right path.{/i}\""
    mon "\"{i}Haec sunt quae evenient. Rectam viam sequeris.{/i}\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:409
translate latin a3s2_3bf0a337:

    # "But am I?"
    "Sed num ita est?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:410
translate latin a3s2_d168a122:

    # n "\"[mc].\""
    n "\"[mc].\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:411
translate latin a3s2_2527d43f:

    # "Neferu whispers hurriedly at me."
    "Neferu mihi festinanter susurrat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:412
translate latin a3s2_39a85e0f:

    # "Cato hits Amicus again, even though the other wolf has stopped moving, and Amicus jerks under the weight of the slightly larger wolf."
    "Cato Amicum iterum ferit, etsi alter lupus moveri desiit; Amicus sub pondere lupi paulo maioris subsilit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:413
translate latin a3s2_a7210550:

    # n "\"[mc], you must run, Cato likely does not know you're here.\""
    n "\"[mc], fugere debes; Cato te adesse probabiliter nescit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:414
translate latin a3s2_3a89db1d:

    # "Amicus's eyes are half-closed, unaware for his last moments as Cato pushes his rear down the other wolf's thighs, giving himself room to reach Amicus's neck."
    "Oculi Amici semiclusi sunt; ultimis suis momentis nihil sentit, dum Cato nates suas deorsum per femora alterius lupi movet ut ad collum Amici accedere possit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:415
translate latin a3s2_decea15d:

    # n "\"Run to the city, to the woods...anywhere...\""
    n "\"Fuge ad urbem, ad silvas...quolibet...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:416
translate latin a3s2_f5d83df7:

    # "I shake my head silently."
    "Caput tacitus quatio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:417
translate latin a3s2_75b4c966:

    # "Was this really meant to happen?"
    "Num hoc revera fieri destinatum erat?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:418
translate latin a3s2_7017bfb2:

    # "Why was I put on this path if it ended in my wolf's death?"
    "Cur in hanc viam positus sum, si haec ad mortem lupi mei ducit?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:419
translate latin a3s2_e2ec28a0:

    # "Why aren't the parents helping me?"
    "Cur Parentes me non adiuvant?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:423
translate latin a3s2_26b87b59:

    # "At that moment, the light of the setting sun catches something shiny to my left."
    "Eo momento lux solis occidentis aliquid nitens ad sinistram meam illuminat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:424
translate latin a3s2_c95560fb:

    # "I look over, and I'm almost blinded by the brilliant reflection of Vita's light on the blade of the dagger."
    "Illuc aspicio et splendida lucis Vitae repercussione in lamina pugionis paene occaecor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:425
translate latin a3s2_7cdca88a:

    # "The one that Cato had set aside after almost executing Neferu."
    "Illius quem Cato deposuerat postquam Neferu paene supplicio affecerat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:426
translate latin a3s2_2041fe9d:

    # "Red and blue jewels decorate the handle while the gold blade shines brighter than any metal I've seen before."
    "Gemmae rubrae caeruleaeque capulum ornant, dum aurea lamina omni metallo quod antea vidi clarius fulget."

# game/a3s2.rpy:427
translate latin a3s2_137a1540:

    # "{i}The rules don't matter.{/i}"
    "{i}Regulae nihil referunt.{/i}"

# game/a3s2.rpy:428
translate latin a3s2_8ff43bf5:

    # "Robotically, I lean over the aisle and grab the dagger by the handle."
    "Quasi automatum, ultra viam inter sedilia me inclino et pugionem capulo prehendo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:429
translate latin a3s2_a3f1000c:

    # n "\"[mc]?\""
    n "\"[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:430
translate latin a3s2_8b29a37c:

    # "I ignore Neferu, and at the same time I see Virginia directly across from me."
    "Neferu neglego; simul Virginiam recta contra me video."

# game/a3s2.rpy:431
translate latin a3s2_2188d4a4:

    # "Her eyes are wide, and she's standing too, but instead of looking at the fight, at Cato's jaws coming closer and closer to Amicus's neck, she's instead looking at me and pointing."
    "Oculi eius dilatati sunt; ipsa quoque stat. Neque pugnam neque fauces Catonis magis magisque ad collum Amici accedentes spectat; me aspicit et digito aliquid indicat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:432
translate latin a3s2_4fc3355c:

    # "She's pointing right at Cato, silently encouraging me to do what I'm about to do."
    "Catonem ipsum demonstrat, tacite me hortans ut faciam quod iam facturus sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:433
translate latin a3s2_c3a8caa5:

    # "But I don't need encouragement."
    "Sed hortatione non egeo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:434
translate latin a3s2_f6b0ad8c:

    # "The rules don't matter."
    "Regulae nihil referunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:435
translate latin a3s2_517d3aef:

    # "I jump from my seat, the distance so little that I come down practically on top of the wolves."
    "E sedili meo insilio; tam parvum est intervallum ut paene in lupos ipsos descendam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:436
translate latin a3s2_74a0db13:

    # "At the same time, I raise the dagger in both hands over my head and bring it down as hard as I can into Cato's back."
    "Simul pugionem ambabus manibus supra caput tollo atque quam validissime possum in dorsum Catonis deicio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:438
translate latin a3s2_5d5c1ff4:

    # "As if in slow-motion, I feel the blade slide into my target, very easily at first, like cutting through butter..."
    "Quasi omnia tarde moveantur, laminam in corpus petitum labi sentio, primo facillime, quasi butyrum secans..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:439
translate latin a3s2_42f45f55:

    # "...then suddenly I feel something hard, and there's an odd, muffled, stuttered sound of friction as the blade slows considerably."
    "...tum subito aliquid durum sentio et insolitus sonus frictionis, obtusus et interruptus, oritur dum lamina valde retardatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:440
translate latin a3s2_8485654c:

    # "It continues to sink in though, in sudden bursts of a few inches at a time, and it's only when the hilt reaches Cato's fur that I realize that I've cut deep into bone...a rib maybe."
    "Tamen mergi pergit, subitis motibus paucos pollices singulis penetrans; tantum cum capulus pilos Catonis attingit intellego me alte in os secuisse...costam fortasse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:441
translate latin a3s2_50748af5:

    # "Cato howls, suddenly arching back, and I can only hope I was fast enough that he wasn't able to sink his teeth into Amicus's neck."
    "Cato ululat, subito dorsum arcuans; sperare tantum possum me satis celerem fuisse ut dentes in collum Amici figere non potuerit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:442
translate latin a3s2_97d2ff23:

    # "I'm not finished though, and I tug once, then twice, before I'm finally able to wrench the blade out of the bone."
    "Sed nondum finivi; semel traho, deinde iterum, antequam tandem laminam ex osse evellere valeo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:443
translate latin a3s2_bd5ee4c1:

    # "For that split second, Cato begins reaching back awkwardly, unable to find my weapon before I've drawn it back again, above my head before bringing it down as hard as I can into the right side of Cato's neck, just at the base."
    "Per illud brevissimum momentum Cato ineleganter retro manum tendere incipit, telum meum invenire non valens antequam id iterum supra caput retraho, deinde quam validissime in dextrum latus colli Catonis, ad imam partem ipsam, deicio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:445
translate latin a3s2_e7b708ec:

    # "This time, the blade sinks in easily, once again all the way to the hilt."
    "Hoc tempore lamina facile mergitur, iterum usque ad capulum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:446
translate latin a3s2_0237c3fb:

    # "I yank it back once more, intent on plunging it in again, but finally, Cato turns on me, blindly swinging his paw out."
    "Iterum evello, ut denuo infigam; sed tandem Cato ad me vertitur, manum caecus iactans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:447
translate latin a3s2_35462404:

    # "His fingers find my right forearm as I'm raising the blade once again, and he takes a tight hold."
    "Digiti eius antibrachium meum dextrum inveniunt dum laminam rursus tollo; firmiter prehendit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:448
translate latin a3s2_fa4529f0:

    # ca "\"[mc]!\""
    ca "\"[mc]!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:449
translate latin a3s2_ea22df9a:

    # "His exclamation is part astonishment, part fury."
    "Exclamatio eius partim stuporem, partim furorem exprimit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:450
translate latin a3s2_220c10ba:

    # "His other paw finds the dagger, and even though I try to hold on to it, he slides it out of my hands with ease, even though he's holding on to the blade end."
    "Altera manus pugionem invenit; quamquam retinere conor, e manibus meis facile extrahit, etsi laminam ipsam tenet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:451
translate latin a3s2_598b2f65:

    # "Blood is everywhere at this point, and I can only hope it's only Cato's."
    "Iam sanguis ubique est; Catonis tantum esse sperare possum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:452
translate latin a3s2_88228076:

    # "I start to back away, trying to look down at Amicus to see what's happened to him, but that's when Cato swings at me again."
    "Recedere incipio, ad Amicum deorsum aspicere conans ut videam quid ei acciderit; tum autem Cato me iterum ferire conatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:455
translate latin a3s2_2a581496:

    # "I feel air tickle my neck and chin, and for a moment I think I've dodged his swing..."
    "Aer collum et mentum meum titillat; momento ictum eius effugisse me puto..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:456
translate latin a3s2_9a4f54d9:

    # "...but then I see that he's holding out the blade, out to his right after having swung it at me."
    "...sed tum video eum laminam tendere ad dextram suam, postquam eam in me vibravit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:457
translate latin a3s2_4ecabfa8:

    # "{cps=10}..."
    "{cps=10}..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:458
translate latin a3s2_41664f19:

    # "Something's wrong."
    "Aliquid male se habet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:459
translate latin a3s2_67a9abe2:

    # "Something's very wrong."
    "Aliquid pessime se habet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:460
translate latin a3s2_375f9f8d:

    # "I look down and see a sudden spurt of blood, splattering the stones below me, then another spurt, then another."
    "Deorsum aspicio et subitum sanguinis fontem lapides sub me respergentem video, deinde alterum fontem, deinde alterum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:461
translate latin a3s2_174c0bfc:

    # "I step back again and gasp, and when I do, it feels like the air comes in from two places at once, and I cough as something liquid goes down my throat the wrong way."
    "Iterum recedo et spiritum duco; dum id facio, aer duobus locis simul intrare videtur, et tussio cum aliquid liquidum in gulam meam per falsam viam descendit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:462
translate latin a3s2_6aa93f53:

    # "Again, I gasp, and this time I hear a bubbling sound from my throat, and I finally understand what's happened as I raise my hands to my neck, stumbling then falling."
    "Iterum spiritum duco; hoc tempore sonum bullientem e gula audio et tandem quid acciderit intellego, dum manus ad collum tollo, titubans ac deinde cadens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:463
translate latin a3s2_808c0455:

    # "I expect to slam back against the stone seats, but instead it's against something furry and warm."
    "Exspecto me retrorsum in lapidea sedilia collisurum; sed in aliquid pilosum et calidum incido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:464
translate latin a3s2_d81e3902:

    # "I look up and see Neferu sitting over me as he'd moved to catch me with his lap."
    "Sursum aspicio et Neferu supra me sedentem video, qui se moverat ut me gremio exciperet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:466
translate latin a3s2_07163f5b:

    # "He's staring at me with a look of horror on his face."
    "Me intuetur vultu horrore pleno."

# game/a3s2.rpy:467
translate latin a3s2_28ca8198:

    # n "\"[mc]...\""
    n "\"[mc]...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:468
translate latin a3s2_04ee6667:

    # "He looks up."
    "Sursum aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:469
translate latin a3s2_64053563:

    # n "\"Amicus...Amicus, wake up and help him!\""
    n "\"Amice...Amice, expergiscere et eum adiuva!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:470
translate latin a3s2_ba854869:

    # "I frown, still worried about Cato, and sure enough, as I look forward, I see the false emperor on one knee, clasping his neck, bleeding just as much as I am."
    "Frontem contraho, de Catone adhuc sollicitus; et sane, cum ante me aspicio, falsum imperatorem uno genu nitentem video, collum prementem, tantum sanguinis quantum ego effundentem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:472
translate latin a3s2_18f9c0f9:

    # "His ears are perked forward, toward Neferu's voice, and I see him start to make his way toward us."
    "Aures eius ad vocem Neferu intentae sunt; eum ad nos accedere incipientem video."

# game/a3s2.rpy:473
translate latin a3s2_35af806b:

    # ca "\"K—Khemian...\""
    ca "\"Kh—Khemiane...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:474
translate latin a3s2_1a25fb59:

    # "The wolf's eyes are wild, furious, focused in the direction of Neferu."
    "Oculi lupi feroces sunt, furiosi, ad Neferu intenti."

# game/a3s2.rpy:475
translate latin a3s2_40c99017:

    # "He seems to have already forgotten me, even as he seems to realize that he's dying."
    "Me iam oblitus esse videtur, etiam dum se mori intellegere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:476
translate latin a3s2_56d9ec7b:

    # ca "\"You...you...caused this...\""
    ca "\"Tu...tu...hoc effecisti...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:477
translate latin a3s2_401c89c1:

    # "I feel that those words \"you\" and \"this\" carry much more meaning for Cato than I could ever hope to know."
    "Sentio illa verba \"tu\" et \"hoc\" Catoni multo plus significare quam umquam cognoscere sperare possim."

# game/a3s2.rpy:478
translate latin a3s2_f943d01b:

    # "It's a strange moment as I lay in Neferu's lap, bleeding out."
    "Insolitum momentum est dum in gremio Neferu iaceo, sanguinem amittens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:479
translate latin a3s2_1173285b:

    # "I suppose I knew Cato blamed the Khemians for most of his problems, for most of the problems in the empire."
    "Catonem Khemianos plerarumque aerumnarum suarum atque plerarumque difficultatum imperii accusare sciebam, credo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:480
translate latin a3s2_8f16ec1c:

    # "He tried to hide it by pretending to give Amicus a fair shot at the emperorship."
    "Id celare conatus est, simulans se Amico aequam occasionem imperium adipiscendi dare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:481
translate latin a3s2_79d6d22b:

    # "As that slowly unraveled, his intentions became clear, and so did his insanity."
    "Cum illa simulatio paulatim dissolveretur, consilia eius patefacta sunt, et insania quoque."

# game/a3s2.rpy:482
translate latin a3s2_c6333c36:

    # "He intends to kill Neferu to completely kill any chance of an alliance, even if it means the complete destruction of the wolven empire."
    "Neferu necare intendit ut omnem societatis spem penitus exstinguat, etiamsi hoc totius imperii Luporum exitium significet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:483
translate latin a3s2_b2da5410:

    # "Somehow that's a risk worth taking for Cato."
    "Nescio quo modo Catoni illud periculum subire operae pretium videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:484
translate latin a3s2_a7c434d4:

    # "The old wolf draws closer, practically crawling now, leaving heavy splatters of blood across the ground."
    "Senex lupus propius accedit, iam paene reptans, terram largis sanguinis maculis respergens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:485
translate latin a3s2_fe76ff50:

    # "He weakly raises the dagger, and I feel Neferu tense behind me, probably getting ready to roll out of the way, but then something wraps around Cato's neck."
    "Debilis pugionem tollit; Neferu post me contrahi sentio, probabiliter parantem se volvere ut effugiat, sed tum aliquid collum Catonis circumdat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:486
translate latin a3s2_04877949:

    # "With a gargled choke, Cato is pulled back by Amicus before being body slammed to the ground."
    "Cum strangulato gurgitu Cato ab Amico retrahitur, deinde toto corpore in terram deicitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:487
translate latin a3s2_3d98d1c2:

    # "Then, Amicus is on the old wolf, muzzle against his neck, tearing it apart."
    "Tum Amicus seni lupo insidet, rostro ad collum admoto, id dilacerans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:488
translate latin a3s2_2823521b:

    # "I stare in shock, then look down, away from the horror of what I'm seeing."
    "Attonitus specto, deinde deorsum aspicio, me ab eo quod horrendum video avertens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:489
translate latin a3s2_44bd8b08:

    # "And that's when I see myself covered in blood...so, so much blood."
    "Tum me sanguine coopertum video...tam, tam multo sanguine."

# game/a3s2.rpy:490
translate latin a3s2_a6c04166:

    # "My entire naked torso is painted red, and more of it continues to pour over my chest in waves, though it's less than the initial spurts I'd seen when I was standing up."
    "Totus nudus truncus meus sanguine rubro pictus est; plus sanguinis fluctibus per pectus meum defluere pergit, quamquam minus quam primi fontes quos stans videram."

# game/a3s2.rpy:491
translate latin a3s2_82c88166:

    # "I raise my hands to my neck, still feeling that strange, cold feeling reaching deep into my throat, like everything's open and exposed to the air."
    "Manus ad collum tollo, adhuc illum sensum insoliti frigoris alte in gulam penetrantem sentiens, quasi omnia aperta sint atque aeri exposita."

# game/a3s2.rpy:492
translate latin a3s2_de161f3c:

    # "I try to talk, to tell Neferu that I need help, but only a raspy, bubbling hiss comes out of my neck."
    "Loqui conor, Neferu dicere me auxilio egere, sed sibilus tantum raucus et bulliens e collo exit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:493
translate latin a3s2_5cb05a7a:

    # "I look up, seeing Neferu looking down at me, his expression again one of disbelief."
    "Sursum aspicio; Neferu ad me deorsum spectat, vultu iterum incredulo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:494
translate latin a3s2_a46f8142:

    # "I suppose it would be pretty shocking to see your friend with his neck open, dying in your lap."
    "Amicum collo aperto in gremio tuo morientem videre sane attonitum te faceret, credo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:495
translate latin a3s2_e82a2965:

    # "Am I dying?"
    "Moriorne?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:496
translate latin a3s2_970659b9:

    # "I try to cover my neck again, but the gash is so deep...it feels like if I lean too far back my head will just...flop over onto my back."
    "Collum iterum tegere conor, sed vulnus tam altum est...si nimis retro me inclinem, caput mihi in dorsum...cadere posse videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:497
translate latin a3s2_1a0f89b1:

    # "Vaguely, I hear Amicus's snarling sounds, along with Cato's raspy screams, sounding just like me when I was trying to talk."
    "Vage fremitus Amici audio cum clamoribus Catonis raucis, prorsus sicut ego cum loqui conabar sonantibus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:498
translate latin a3s2_5a365810:

    # "The edges of my vision start to go blurry and black and Neferu's face starts to fade away..."
    "Margines visus mei obscuri et nigri fieri incipiunt; facies Neferu evanescere incipit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:500
translate latin a3s2_16adeb6f:

    # "...then suddenly there's a big shift and I wake back up, this time finding Amicus looking down at me."
    "...tum subito magna motio fit et iterum expergiscor; hoc tempore Amicum ad me deorsum aspicientem invenio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:503
translate latin a3s2_600c1ab2:

    # "An overwhelming sense of relief comes over me."
    "Ingenti sensu levamenti perfundor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:504
translate latin a3s2_e51d5ef5:

    # "I do get to see my wolf after all."
    "Lupum meum tamen videre mihi licet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:505
translate latin a3s2_c34b6425:

    # "I smile up at him, even as he stares at me with a look of complete and utter devastation."
    "Ad eum sursum subrideo, etsi ille me intuetur vultu omnino et penitus fracto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:506
translate latin a3s2_5acd0dc1:

    # a "\"No, no, no, no, no, please! Get Felix...Virginia, tell Alex to get Felix!\""
    a "\"Non, non, non, non, non, quaeso! Arcesse Felicem...Virginia, dic Alex ut Felicem arcessat!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:507
translate latin a3s2_ea0f2d93:

    # "His tears start to fall on my face, and I reach up, trying to brush them away like he's done for me a few times."
    "Lacrimae eius in faciem meam cadere incipiunt; manum tollo, eas abstergere conans sicut ille mihi aliquoties fecit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:508
translate latin a3s2_0a96062a:

    # "He catches my hand before I can though, pressing it back to my neck."
    "Sed antequam possim, manum meam capit atque ad collum meum reprimit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:509
translate latin a3s2_984df0c6:

    # a "\"You'll be fine! You're going to be fine! It's not bad...It's not bad...\""
    a "\"Bene valebis! Bene valebis! Non grave est...Non grave est...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:510
translate latin a3s2_9b250a2d:

    # "I actually chuckle a little at that because this is {i}very{/i} bad."
    "Ad haec etiam paululum rideo, quia hoc {i}gravissimum{/i} est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:511
translate latin a3s2_1e4e2dc4:

    # "I can tell without even being able to see it."
    "Id sentire possum etsi videre non valeo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:512
translate latin a3s2_5360e5f4:

    # "I see the edges of my vision blurring again, and my eyes seem to try and roll upward on their own, but Amicus gives me a little shake and that brings me back for a moment."
    "Margines visus mei iterum obscurari video; oculi sursum sua sponte volvi conari videntur, sed Amicus paululum me quatit et me paulisper ad sensus reducit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:513
translate latin a3s2_ffa9c5a0:

    # a "\"Hey! Hey, stay here, okay? You'll stay with me, yeah?\""
    a "\"Heus! Heus, hic mane, bene? Mecum manebis, vero?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:514
translate latin a3s2_efadf775:

    # "I nod deliriously, the overwhelming feeling of calm and warmth keeping me happy and full of love, even though I know what's happening, what's about to happen to me."
    "Delirans annuo; ingens tranquillitatis et caloris sensus me beatum amoreque plenum retinet, etsi scio quid fiat, quid mihi iam iam futurum sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:515
translate latin a3s2_042818bf:

    # "\"I'm here.\""
    "\"Hic sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:516
translate latin a3s2_f2a2857f:

    # "I try to speak, but I only send more bubbling blood out of my neck."
    "Loqui conor, sed plus tantum sanguinis bullientis e collo expello."

# game/a3s2.rpy:517
translate latin a3s2_47d59596:

    # a "\"No, no! You don't need to talk. I have you.\""
    a "\"Non, non! Non opus est ut loquaris. Te teneo.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:518
translate latin a3s2_510c09e6:

    # "How unfair."
    "Quam iniquum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:519
translate latin a3s2_d3524af6:

    # "My last moments and I can't even tell my wolf that I love him."
    "Ultima momenta mea, neque lupo meo dicere possum me eum amare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:520
translate latin a3s2_b6940032:

    # "I reach up with my free hand, setting it gently against Amicus's face."
    "Manum liberam tollo, leniter faciei Amici admovens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:521
translate latin a3s2_84e9a713:

    # "I caress his cheek softly, knowingly, and though he holds it against his face with his own free paw, he shakes his head at me."
    "Genam eius molliter et conscius permulceo; quamquam manu sua libera eam contra faciem retinet, caput ad me quatit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:522
translate latin a3s2_443cf07d:

    # a "\"Stop that, you're going to be fine. Felix will heal you, we'll rest in my room, I'll take you to the island...I'll take you to the city...we'll be happy...we'll grow old...together.\""
    a "\"Desine; bene valebis. Felix te sanabit, in cubiculo meo requiescemus, te ad insulam ducam...te ad urbem ducam...beati erimus...senescemus...una.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:523
translate latin a3s2_8b9ffcdc:

    # "The tears start spilling over again, and I just try to keep the smile on my face, to show Amicus that I'm okay, that I'm happy, that this is all okay."
    "Lacrimae iterum effluere incipiunt; ego tantum risum in facie retinere conor, ut Amico ostendam mihi bene esse, me beatum esse, haec omnia bene se habere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:524
translate latin a3s2_157739ed:

    # "And though his grief is hard to look at, there's nothing I'd rather be seeing at the end; my wolf's face, framed by the pinkish-reds of the sunset."
    "Quamquam dolorem eius aspicere difficile est, nihil aliud in fine videre malim: vultum lupi mei, rubris roseisque solis occidentis coloribus circumdatum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:525
translate latin a3s2_b1d214ca:

    # "And then, as my eyes start rolling back again, I can't stop them, no matter how hard Amicus shakes me."
    "Tum, cum oculi mei iterum retro volvi incipiunt, eos sistere non possum, quantumvis vehementer Amicus me quatiat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:528
translate latin a3s2_92294901:

    # a "\"[mc]! No, please! Don't leave me here! Please, come back to me! You can't leave me to be alone like this!\""
    a "\"[mc]! Non, quaeso! Noli me hic relinquere! Quaeso, ad me redi! Non potes me ita solum relinquere!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:529
translate latin a3s2_042818bf_1:

    # "\"I'm here.\""
    "\"Hic sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:530
translate latin a3s2_7af048ec:

    # a "\"No, no, no...speak to me!\""
    a "\"Non, non, non...loquere mihi!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:531
translate latin a3s2_6a68bdeb:

    # "\"I'm staying with you...\""
    "\"Tecum maneo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:533
translate latin a3s2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:534
translate latin a3s2_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:535
translate latin a3s2_a20cefa7_2:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:538
translate latin a3s2_5f021f95:

    # "I drift through the blackness, feeling a sense of peace like I've never known before."
    "Per tenebras fluito, pacem sentiens qualem numquam antea novi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:539
translate latin a3s2_e28f3bf4:

    # "Even though the space is empty, I feel it crowded with others, so many others...or is it one other?"
    "Quamquam spatium vacuum est, id aliis refertum sentio, tam multis aliis...an uno alio?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:540
translate latin a3s2_4635a98b:

    # "I sense so many different minds and thoughts, melded together as one."
    "Tot diversas mentes cogitationesque sentio, in unum coniunctas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:541
translate latin a3s2_6b70b450:

    # "\"Hello...\""
    "\"Salve...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:542
translate latin a3s2_904736e9:

    # "\"We must apologize for what has happened to you.\""
    "\"Veniam petere debemus ob id quod tibi accidit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:543
translate latin a3s2_13859245:

    # "\"It was not our intention for it to end this way.\""
    "\"Non hoc modo rem finiri volueramus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:544
translate latin a3s2_9469c842:

    # "\"While not ideal, you have still moved the work of Meera forward.\""
    "\"Quamquam optimum non est, opus Meerae tamen promovisti.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:545
translate latin a3s2_70ce5554:

    # "\"Though we intended for you to complete it, this can be done at a later stage, by a latter sapient.\""
    "\"Quamquam volebamus ut tu id perficeres, hoc posteriore tempore a posteriore Sapiente perfici potest.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:546
translate latin a3s2_88620a1b:

    # "\"Thank you, [mc], for doing your part for humankind, for wolves, for the {i}Galaxias{/i} as a whole.\""
    "\"Gratias tibi, [mc], quod partes tuas pro genere humano, pro lupis, pro toto {i}Galaxias{/i} egisti.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:547
translate latin a3s2_fb0636cf:

    # "\"Now go, be at peace, be one with the amalgamation of intelligence from whence you came.\""
    "\"Nunc abi, pace fruere, unus esto cum coniuncta intellegentia unde venisti.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:548
translate latin a3s2_d9642c1e:

    # "\"Thank you...\""
    "\"Gratias tibi...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:549
translate latin a3s2_11915e83:

    # "I begin to dissolve."
    "Dissolvi incipio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:550
translate latin a3s2_e0b75cd9:

    # "I'm nowhere and everywhere."
    "Nusquam et ubique sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:551
translate latin a3s2_2810678a:

    # "I'm never and always."
    "Numquam et semper sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:552
translate latin a3s2_a170129b:

    # "I'm nothing..."
    "Nihil sum..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:553
translate latin a3s2_949df7da:

    # "...and everything."
    "...et omnia."

# game/a3s2.rpy:555
translate latin a3s2_95f4861d:

    # "{cps=10}...all at once..."
    "{cps=10}...omnia simul..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:559
translate latin a3s2_5f021f95_1:

    # "I drift through the blackness, feeling a sense of peace like I've never known before."
    "Per tenebras fluito, pacem sentiens qualem numquam antea novi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:560
translate latin a3s2_e28f3bf4_1:

    # "Even though the space is empty, I feel it crowded with others, so many others...or is it one other?"
    "Quamquam spatium vacuum est, id aliis refertum sentio, tam multis aliis...an uno alio?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:561
translate latin a3s2_4635a98b_1:

    # "I sense so many different minds and thoughts, melded together as one."
    "Tot diversas mentes cogitationesque sentio, in unum coniunctas."

# game/a3s2.rpy:562
translate latin a3s2_6b70b450_1:

    # "\"Hello...\""
    "\"Salve...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:563
translate latin a3s2_9c942f6b:

    # "\"We apologize for what has happened to you.\""
    "\"Veniam petimus ob id quod tibi accidit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:564
translate latin a3s2_83c57694:

    # "\"We know that you are confused.\""
    "\"Scimus te confusum esse.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:565
translate latin a3s2_f084a14e:

    # "\"We told you that this could be prevented...\""
    "\"Diximus tibi hoc impediri posse...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:566
translate latin a3s2_1b98a2dc:

    # "\"...and it will be.\""
    "\"...et impedietur.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:567
translate latin a3s2_48d712de:

    # "\"You will not leave him to be alone.\""
    "\"Non eum solum relinques.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:569
translate latin a3s2_1ba51063:

    # "\"Be at peace for now, for he will come for you.\""
    "\"Nunc pace fruere, quia te petet.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:570
translate latin a3s2_7489b341:

    # "\"Wait for him...\""
    "\"Eum exspecta...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:571
translate latin a3s2_a20cefa7_3:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:575
translate latin a3s2_dec844b1:

    # com "\"Amicus is the victor. All hail Emperor Amicus.\""
    com "\"Amicus victor est. Omnes imperatorem Amicum salutate.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:576
translate latin a3s2_bcc7a45b:

    # "The words sound hollow in Amicus's ears, and so does the faint roar of the crowds in Adastra City all the way across the lake."
    "Verba in auribus Amici inania sonant, sicut tenuis clamor turbarum in urbe Adastra, longe trans lacum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:577
translate latin a3s2_b27b318d:

    # "The wolf can only stare down at the human in his arms, suddenly realizing how light and fragile he actually is."
    "Lupus nihil nisi humanum in brachiis suis deorsum spectare potest, subito intellegens quam levis et fragilis revera sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:578
translate latin a3s2_eef90f02:

    # "And the blood..."
    "Et sanguis..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:579
translate latin a3s2_fdb3aef1:

    # "...so much blood that paints the front of his human that just moments ago had been so full of life."
    "...tam multus sanguis qui anteriorem partem humani sui tingit, qui modo ante pauca momenta tam plenus vitae fuerat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:580
translate latin a3s2_9b031ffb:

    # "A tear drops from the tip of Amicus's nose and onto [mc]'s neck, mixing with the blood that has now stopped flowing from the deep gash."
    "Lacrima ab apice nasi Amici in collum [mc] cadit et sanguini miscetur, qui ex alto vulnere iam fluere desiit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:581
translate latin a3s2_5ed51327:

    # "Air no longer bubbles through the red liquid either."
    "Aer quoque per liquidum rubrum iam non bullit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:582
translate latin a3s2_53f5847f:

    # "A strange, choking sound works its way out of Amicus's lips, one he's never heard himself make before."
    "Insolitus strangulatus sonus e labiis Amici emergit, qualem se edere numquam antea audivit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:583
translate latin a3s2_0d866733:

    # "The overflowing sadness in his heart has seemingly run out to be replaced by something empty, cold..."
    "Tristitia redundans in corde eius exhausta videtur, in cuius locum aliquid vacuum, frigidum successit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:584
translate latin a3s2_a369a867:

    # "...like there's nothing there anymore."
    "...quasi ibi nihil iam insit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:585
translate latin a3s2_4fabaf8d:

    # "Still, Amicus wills the human to live, to use those special healing abilities he seemed to possess, to breathe again."
    "Tamen Amicus humanum vivere vult, illis peculiaribus facultatibus sanandi uti quas habere videbatur, iterum spirare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:586
translate latin a3s2_d8ac5031:

    # "But even as Virginia moves to find Felix, Amicus knows that nothing can be done for something like this."
    "Sed etiam dum Virginia Felicem quaesitum it, Amicus scit ad rem talem nihil fieri posse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:587
translate latin a3s2_62c746df:

    # "Cato had very nearly beheaded the human, cutting through everything that was important."
    "Cato humanum paene decollaverat, omnia quae necessaria erant secans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:588
translate latin a3s2_73db9c7f:

    # "Cradling [mc]'s head carefully, Amicus raises the young human up to his chest, hugging him tightly, squeezing his eyes shut and feeling the welling tears pour out over his cheeks, down his chin and to the human's hair."
    "Caput [mc] caute sustinens, Amicus iuvenem humanum ad pectus tollit, arcte amplectens, oculos comprimens atque lacrimas crescentes per genas, deorsum per mentum ad capillos humani effluere sentiens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:589
translate latin a3s2_0a8909d7:

    # "It's quiet, and Amicus opens his eyes to see Neferu still sitting there in front of him, staring in shock."
    "Silentium est; Amicus oculos aperit et Neferu adhuc ante se sedentem videt, attonitum spectantem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:591
translate latin a3s2_c38601c4:

    # "When the jackal meets his eyes, he quickly dips his head, lowering his ears."
    "Cum chacalus oculos Amici aspicit, cito caput inclinat atque aures demittit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:593
translate latin a3s2_7cec4a16:

    # n "\"Amicus, I—I'm so sorry...\""
    n "\"Amice, e—ego tam doleo...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:595
translate latin a3s2_7e5c4066:

    # "The wolf raises his eyes to see a drone just over Neferu's head, hovering as its lens focuses voyeuristically on him, broadcasting his grief to Adastra."
    "Lupus oculos tollit et automatum volatile recta supra caput Neferu suspensum videt, quod lentem suam in eum impudenter dirigit, luctum lupi Adastrae transmittens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:596
translate latin a3s2_3496299c:

    # "But this is nothing like those dramas, the tragedies of romantic death he'd seen play out on the screens so many times before."
    "Sed hoc nihil illis fabulis simile est, tragoediis mortis amatoriae quas toties in tabulis agi viderat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:597
translate latin a3s2_99a422d1:

    # "There is {i}nothing{/i} romantic about this, as Amicus is sure his audience is finding it to be right now."
    "In hoc {i}nihil{/i} amatorium inest, quamquam Amicus certus est spectatores suos nunc id ita existimare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:598
translate latin a3s2_8f5e4e97:

    # "This is real death, and the feeling is familiar."
    "Haec vera mors est et sensus familiaris."

# game/a3s2.rpy:599
translate latin a3s2_f0dfd5bb:

    # "It's hollow, empty, suffocating, like being pulled down into a bottomless, cold, black ocean."
    "Sensus inanis, vacuus, suffocans est, quasi Amicus in oceanum nigrum, frigidum, sine fundo deorsum trahatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:600
translate latin a3s2_e908bcfc:

    # "It's like when mother died and Cassius had screamed over her body like a wounded animal."
    "Sicut cum mater mortua est et Cassius super corpus eius velut animal vulneratum clamavit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:601
translate latin a3s2_682607f1:

    # "It's like when he heard the news father had died and how he'd fallen to his knees, clutching his chest and gasping for air like he'd been shot."
    "Sicut cum nuntium accepit patrem mortuum esse, et in genua cecidit, pectus prehendens et aerem anhelans quasi telo percussus esset."

# game/a3s2.rpy:602
translate latin a3s2_10d8ef0b:

    # "But this is worse somehow, and Amicus can't even comprehend it."
    "Sed hoc nescio quo modo peius est, neque Amicus id comprehendere potest."

# game/a3s2.rpy:603
translate latin a3s2_b261a2c0:

    # "It hits him harder than anything he's felt in his life."
    "Vehementius eum ferit quam quidquid in vita sua sensit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:604
translate latin a3s2_92606b7f:

    # "Everything is going gray, the color being sucked from his vision, from his life..."
    "Omnia canescunt, colore e visu eius, e vita eius exhausto..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:605
translate latin a3s2_87c38cfd:

    # "And even though he's not sobbing now, the tears are flowing freely down his cheeks."
    "Et quamquam nunc non singultat, lacrimae libere per genas fluunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:606
translate latin a3s2_df7dafab:

    # "He isn't sure how he can recover from this at all...he knows he probably never will."
    "Nescit quomodo ex hoc omnino recreari possit...scit se probabiliter numquam posse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:607
translate latin a3s2_14f885aa:

    # "This is his fault."
    "Hoc culpa eius est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:608
translate latin a3s2_e39910a3:

    # "He'd forced the human here."
    "Humanum huc coegerat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:609
translate latin a3s2_b30c8211:

    # "He'd made himself feel better by saying [mc] had a choice in the matter, was free to do as he pleased."
    "Se consolatus erat dicens [mc] in hac re eligere potuisse atque liberum ei fuisse facere quidquid vellet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:610
translate latin a3s2_ea7255b5:

    # "But that wasn't true at all."
    "Sed hoc omnino verum non erat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:611
translate latin a3s2_0251d64d:

    # "He'd taken the human's life, just as Cato had now."
    "Vitam humani abstulerat, sicut nunc Cato."

# game/a3s2.rpy:612
translate latin a3s2_f6efc8b3:

    # "Amicus realizes then that he's no different from the wolves he'd thought himself to be above."
    "Amicus tum intellegit se nihil ab illis lupis differre quibus se superiorem putaverat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:613
translate latin a3s2_c2ee6328:

    # "That he was more enlightened somehow in trying to hold all sapient life as equal."
    "Se quodam modo cultiorem esse, cum omnem vitam sapientem parem habere conaretur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:614
translate latin a3s2_bb2e57c4:

    # "He's even worse."
    "Ipse etiam peior est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:615
translate latin a3s2_b7db0654:

    # "And even though it would break his heart never to have met [mc], Amicus only wishes that he'd never brought him here in the first place."
    "Et quamquam numquam [mc] convenisse cor eius frangeret, Amicus tantum optat se eum huc ab initio numquam adduxisse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:616
translate latin a3s2_5bbc0aa0:

    # "To his death."
    "Ad mortem eius."

# game/a3s2.rpy:617
translate latin a3s2_35c1cd7c:

    # "The thought brings another wave of heart-wrenching grief to crash through his hollow chest, and for a moment he almost can't breathe."
    "Cogitatio alterum fluctum doloris cor lacerantis per vacuum pectus impellit; momento paene spirare nequit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:618
translate latin a3s2_3806b6f8:

    # a "\"Please, [mc]...\""
    a "\"Quaeso, [mc]...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:619
translate latin a3s2_caf88a65:

    # "The young wolf whispers into the human's hair, his voice now only a soft whine as fresh tears blur his vision."
    "Iuvenis lupus in capillos humani susurrat, voce iam solo molli gemitu, dum recentes lacrimae visum eius obscurant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:620
translate latin a3s2_3ddcdb82:

    # "His teachings since he was a pup begin to come to mind;"
    "Quae a tempore quo catulus erat didicit in mentem venire incipiunt:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:621
translate latin a3s2_556430a3:

    # "[mc]'s soul, like the soul of all sapients, is ascending to the Greater Intelligence, mingling with the lives of billions of others; with his father, his mother, maybe Cassius, too."
    "Anima [mc], sicut anima omnium Sapientium, ad Maiorem Intellegentiam ascendit, cum vitis miliardorum aliorum se miscens: cum patre ac matre Amici, fortasse Cassio quoque."

# game/a3s2.rpy:622
translate latin a3s2_d350c40f:

    # "A place he'd also join one day..."
    "Locum quem ipse quoque aliquando adiret..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:623
translate latin a3s2_81db397f:

    # "...but..."
    "...sed..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:624
translate latin a3s2_77959326:

    # "...but the human's soul belonged {i}here{/i}, in his arms, not to be mixed and consumed by the parents, not yet."
    "...sed anima humani {i}hic{/i} esse debebat, in brachiis eius, a Parentibus non miscenda et consumenda, nondum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:625
translate latin a3s2_a6cf3261:

    # "That mixed, singular being isn't [mc]."
    "Illa mixta et singularis creatura [mc] non est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:626
translate latin a3s2_b54c9d7e:

    # "It's like a beautiful mural being shattered, then reconstructed into something else."
    "Sicut pulchra pictura muralis frangitur, deinde in aliud restituitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:627
translate latin a3s2_a5a8219f:

    # "[mc] still exists, at this very moment he exists, but it's no longer {i}him{/i}."
    "[mc] adhuc exsistit, hoc ipso momento exsistit, sed illud iam non {i}ipse{/i} est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:628
translate latin a3s2_bab0a133:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth, feeling anger begin to overcome the overwhelming grief."
    "Amicus dentes comprimit, iram immoderatum dolorem superare incipientem sentiens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:629
translate latin a3s2_7072f3b4:

    # "No..."
    "Non..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:630
translate latin a3s2_a3e12093:

    # "...No..."
    "...Non..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:633
translate latin a3s2_36517e23:

    # a "\"...No.\""
    a "\"...Non.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:634
translate latin a3s2_1361ec34:

    # "How dare they."
    "Quomodo ausi sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:635
translate latin a3s2_aea4e2f8:

    # "This isn't fair."
    "Hoc aequum non est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:636
translate latin a3s2_28149d93:

    # "The parents had spoken to [mc], had told him what to do, had lead him to this point."
    "Parentes cum [mc] locuti erant, ei dixerant quid faceret, eum ad hoc punctum duxerant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:637
translate latin a3s2_45303ba8:

    # "When the human had told Amicus that he was worried about something terrible happening..."
    "Cum humanus Amico dixisset se timere ne aliquid horrendum accideret..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:638
translate latin a3s2_1af1d544:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth, remembering how he'd brushed it off, even though he'd told [mc] that he believed him, that he'd have nothing to worry about if he followed their guidance."
    "Amicus dentes comprimit, recordans quomodo id neglexerit, etsi [mc] se ei credere dixisset, nihil ei timendum esse si ductum eorum sequeretur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:639
translate latin a3s2_6e705687:

    # a "\"No...\""
    a "\"Non...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:640
translate latin a3s2_21859b64:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, still clutching onto the human tightly."
    "Amicus caput quatit, humanum adhuc arcte tenens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:642
translate latin a3s2_1ae13089:

    # n "\"Amicus?\""
    n "\"Amice?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:643
translate latin a3s2_58bbb85d:

    # "Neferu's voice is tentative, almost fearful, like he's worried about what Amicus might do."
    "Vox Neferu dubia est, paene timida, quasi ille timeat quid Amicus facturus sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:644
translate latin a3s2_515ac90d:

    # "Amicus isn't even sure of that himself as he rises to his feet, cradling the human in his one good arm, easily able to do so because of their difference in size."
    "Ne Amicus quidem ipse certus est dum in pedes surgit, humanum uno brachio sano sustinens; ob differentiam magnitudinis eorum id facile potest."

# game/a3s2.rpy:646
translate latin a3s2_421cbc0a:

    # "He turns and walks quickly toward the palace, almost jogging, ignoring the various jolts of pain throughout his body."
    "Vertitur et celeriter ad palatium ambulat, paene currens, diversos doloris ictus per corpus neglegens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:647
translate latin a3s2_17524ee7:

    # "He doesn't even glance down at Cato's unmoving body as he passes by."
    "Ne deorsum quidem corpus Catonis immotum aspicit dum praeterit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:648
translate latin a3s2_273984df:

    # "The wolf's expression is stoic now, a strange rage bubbling just under the surface."
    "Vultus lupi nunc immobilis est, insolita rabie sub superficie fervente."

# game/a3s2.rpy:649
translate latin a3s2_6e9bdbb9:

    # n "\"Amicus!\""
    n "\"Amice!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:650
translate latin a3s2_84fddfc5:

    # "Neferu calls after him, but Amicus ignores the jackal, set on one thing, and one thing only:"
    "Neferu post eum clamat, sed Amicus chacalum neglegit, uni rei tantum intentus:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:651
translate latin a3s2_38c1572d:

    # "The parents might have taken his parents, maybe even his brother, but they aren't going to take his human."
    "Licet Parentes parentes Amici abstulerint, fortasse etiam fratrem, humanum tamen eius non auferent."

# game/a3s2.rpy:652
translate latin a3s2_274c8aa0:

    # "He won't allow it."
    "Non permittet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:654
translate latin a3s2_ecfe05fc:

    # "As the wolf enters the palace, he notices Alex pacing the hallway."
    "Cum lupus palatium intrat, Alex per andronem ultro citroque ambulantem animadvertit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:655
translate latin a3s2_d84a91a0:

    # "He stops as he sees the wolf approaching."
    "Consistit cum lupum accedentem videt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:657
translate latin a3s2_3d2e07bb:

    # al "\"Amicus! I heard that you're now emperor and...\""
    al "\"Amice! Audivi te nunc imperatorem esse et...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:658
translate latin a3s2_9dff9815:

    # "He trails off as he sees [mc] cradled in the wolf's arm."
    "Verba eius deficiunt cum [mc] in brachio lupi sustentatum videt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:660
translate latin a3s2_7de95e70:

    # "The blood covering the body, flowing down a limply hanging arm to drip gently from the fingertips."
    "Sanguinem corpus tegentem, per brachium flaccidum pendens fluentem, e digitorum apicibus leniter stillantem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:661
translate latin a3s2_bac66543:

    # "Amicus brushes past the cat, eyes set straight ahead, expressionless."
    "Amicus praeter felem transit, oculis recta ante se fixis, vultu inexpressivo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:663
translate latin a3s2_f8e190be:

    # "Nothing seems to exist outside of the wolf's tunnel vision."
    "Nihil praeter angustum visum lupi exsistere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:664
translate latin a3s2_6fc847b3:

    # "Soon, he comes to the door he's looking for and leans forward, pressing his injured shoulder to the panel to open it, ignoring the blaze of pain that shoots through him as he does."
    "Mox ad ianuam quam quaerit venit et se inclinat, umerum laesum ad tabulam apprimens ut ianuam aperiat; ignem doloris qui corpus eius percurrit neglegit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:666
translate latin a3s2_6125fcbb:

    # "Amicus approaches the archive, glaring at the orb, as if the machinery itself is the parents."
    "Amicus ad archivum accedit, globum torve intuens quasi machina ipsa Parentes sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:667
translate latin a3s2_018d6a80:

    # "The big wolf comes to a stop in front of it, staring up at the glowing blue structure for a moment before looking down at [mc]."
    "Magnus lupus ante id consistit, structuram caeruleam lucentem paulisper sursum spectans antequam deorsum ad [mc] aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:668
translate latin a3s2_675f074f:

    # "The ashen color of the skin is unnerving, so different from the deep tones it once had."
    "Color cutis cinereus animum perturbat, tam diversus a coloribus profundis quos olim habebat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:669
translate latin a3s2_09ba6310:

    # "[mc] is dead, Amicus knows that, but he won't accept it."
    "[mc] mortuus est; Amicus id scit, sed accipere non vult."

# game/a3s2.rpy:670
translate latin a3s2_12e92c8a:

    # "The wolf presses his face close to the human's for a moment, feeling the fading warmth before kissing him gently on the top of his head."
    "Lupus faciem suam faciei humani paulisper admovet, calorem evanescentem sentiens, deinde summum caput eius leniter osculatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:672
translate latin a3s2_af47a4ad:

    # "With that, Amicus leans forward, pressing them both to the sphere."
    "Hoc facto Amicus se inclinat atque ambos globo admovet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:673
translate latin a3s2_17e80ac7:

    # "Then he connects, and he merges with the universe."
    "Tum conectitur et cum universo coalescit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:676
translate latin a3s2_bac0d7c3:

    # "We continue to drift through infinite space, content."
    "Per infinitum spatium contenti fluere pergimus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:678
translate latin a3s2_f6c0387a:

    # "Despite everything, we trust the beings around us, all of us and the others...the parents."
    "Quamvis omnia acciderint, entibus circa nos confidimus, nobis omnibus et aliis...Parentibus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:679
translate latin a3s2_ef2377bb:

    # "The parents."
    "Parentes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:680
translate latin a3s2_569ebb7f:

    # "This was all meant to happen."
    "Haec omnia fieri destinata erant."

# game/a3s2.rpy:681
translate latin a3s2_24bf0b50:

    # "And though it was hard and terrible..."
    "Et quamquam difficile et horrendum erat..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:682
translate latin a3s2_36255a83:

    # "...the worst is now over."
    "...pessima nunc finita sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:683
translate latin a3s2_69406896:

    # "And that thought alone is enough to keep us completely relaxed, waves and waves of relief washing over us."
    "Sola illa cogitatio sufficit ut omnino tranquilli maneamus, fluctibus atque fluctibus levamenti nos perfundentibus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:684
translate latin a3s2_70863461:

    # "In the cacophony of thoughts and emotions though, something stands out..."
    "Sed in tumultu cogitationum et affectuum aliquid eminet..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:685
translate latin a3s2_44c80609:

    # "Though the beings meld together, one seems to become separate for a moment, solely to focus directly on us...on...me..."
    "Quamquam entia coalescunt, unum paulisper separari videtur, tantum ut animum recta ad nos...ad...me...intendat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:686
translate latin a3s2_c7e8e7dc:

    # "This brings me out of my trance for a bit, and I turn my attention on them."
    "Hoc paulisper me ex stupore excitat; animum ad id converto."

# game/a3s2.rpy:687
translate latin a3s2_f95af865:

    # "Amicus?"
    "Amicus?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:688
translate latin a3s2_45d2e564:

    # "But then, as I focus more on this being, I get a different feeling; not {i}him{/i}, but {i}her{/i}."
    "Sed tum, cum hoc ens intentius considero, alium sensum capio: non {i}illum{/i}, sed {i}illam{/i}."

# game/a3s2.rpy:689
translate latin a3s2_5ea7bd41:

    # "It seems like she wants to speak to me."
    "Mihi loqui velle videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:690
translate latin a3s2_ba5ee64b:

    # "She's not familiar, not someone I've spoken to before..."
    "Non mihi nota est; non est aliqua quacum antea locutus sum..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:691
translate latin a3s2_b0cbebab:

    # "But the intensity with which she is focusing on me..."
    "Sed vis qua animum ad me intendit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:692
translate latin a3s2_a805804c:

    # "\"Hello?\""
    "\"Heus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:694
translate latin a3s2_67eae072:

    # "I reach out, but then suddenly the amalgamation of intelligence begins to pull away, and I feel myself extracted from its mass."
    "Manum porrigo, sed tum subito coniuncta intellegentia recedere incipit et me e mole eius extractum sentio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:695
translate latin a3s2_7eaf560a:

    # "The feeling is bizarre and I almost miss the crowding of thoughts and feelings, of being one with many."
    "Sensus insolitus est et paene desidero frequentiam cogitationum affectuumque, cum multis unum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:696
translate latin a3s2_74df6fb5:

    # "But then I feel myself again...my body...beginning to materialize out of nothing."
    "Sed tum me ipsum iterum sentio...corpus meum...e nihilo materiam sumere incipiens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:697
translate latin a3s2_4cfe8eb2:

    # "The nothingness around me slowly becomes something..."
    "Nihil circa me lente aliquid fit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:699
translate latin a3s2_333bd19b:

    # "For a moment, I'm floating in the air...then I'm being held by something strong and solid."
    "Momentum in aere fluito...tum ab aliquo valido et solido teneor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:701
translate latin a3s2_5ab617cb:

    # "The first thing I see is Amicus's face."
    "Primum quod video facies Amici est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:702
translate latin a3s2_61498f36:

    # "He's looking down at me, grim and determined."
    "Ad me deorsum aspicit, gravis et constans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:703
translate latin a3s2_93a42fd0:

    # "Just as I focus on him though, his expression changes."
    "Sed ut primum animum ad eum intendo, vultus eius mutatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:705
translate latin a3s2_804cd142_1:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:706
translate latin a3s2_79ae5c19:

    # "I shift a little, trying to focus better on my wolf."
    "Paululum me moveo, lupum meum intentius aspicere conans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:707
translate latin a3s2_27b7f10b:

    # a "\"[mc]!\""
    a "\"[mc]!\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:710
translate latin a3s2_91844457:

    # "Suddenly, I'm surrounded by fur, getting squeezed tight against Amicus, my face pressed into his neck."
    "Subito pilis circumdor, arcte contra Amicum pressus, facie collo eius admota."

# game/a3s2.rpy:711
translate latin a3s2_654260f4:

    # "Instinctively, I wrap my arms around him."
    "Instinctu brachia ei circumdo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:712
translate latin a3s2_568c08e4:

    # a "\"Oh gods, are you real? Tell me you're real, [mc]...please...\""
    a "\"O di, verus es? Dic mihi te verum esse, [mc]...quaeso...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:713
translate latin a3s2_c1e86123:

    # "He gasps the words, like he's coming up for air after diving to the bottom of the lake."
    "Verba anhelat, quasi e fundo lacus ad aerem emergeret."

# game/a3s2.rpy:714
translate latin a3s2_4d257267:

    # "I'm having trouble remembering things, why he seems so upset."
    "Difficulter recordor rerum gestarum et causae cur tam perturbatus videatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:715
translate latin a3s2_acd74d35:

    # "But I know something bad happened, and now it's over, so I try to comfort him."
    "Sed scio aliquid mali accidisse et nunc finitum esse; itaque eum consolari conor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:716
translate latin a3s2_64ad7a9d:

    # m "\"I'm real...I'm here.\""
    m "\"Verus sum...hic sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:717
translate latin a3s2_5957e9f1:

    # "My voice is strange, like I haven't used it in a while."
    "Vox mea insolita est, quasi ea aliquandiu usus non sim."

# game/a3s2.rpy:718
translate latin a3s2_e618aeb1:

    # "At first, I think I'm back in Amicus's room after I've woken up from the coma, still trying to convince him that everything is okay."
    "Primo puto me rursus in cubiculo Amici esse postquam e comate experrectus sum, adhuc ei persuadere conantem omnia bene se habere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:719
translate latin a3s2_77f922a3:

    # "Like we'd gone to sleep and just woken up and he wants to be reassured again that I'm not going to disappear."
    "Quasi dormivissemus et modo experrecti essemus, et iterum certior fieri velit me non evaniturum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:720
translate latin a3s2_1c7cd8b0:

    # "But then I remember that Cato came in that morning..."
    "Sed tum recordor Catonem illo mane intravisse..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:721
translate latin a3s2_be629d93:

    # "Things fall into place like a long row of giant, heavy dominoes."
    "Res in locos suos cadunt sicut longa series ingentium graviumque lapidum ludi domino."

# game/a3s2.rpy:722
translate latin a3s2_1754378e:

    # "I suddenly sit up a bit, against Amicus's chest, pushing back so I can look up at him."
    "Subito ad pectus Amici paulum me erigo et me ab eo retro removeo ut eum suspicere possim."

# game/a3s2.rpy:723
translate latin a3s2_e640a610:

    # m "\"Wait! The fight...Cato...Amicus, are you okay?\""
    m "\"Mane! Pugna...Cato...Amice, bene vales?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:725
translate latin a3s2_157fc292:

    # "I look him over, trying to check his wounds."
    "Eum inspicio, vulnera eius explorare conans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:726
translate latin a3s2_487ae56a:

    # "The blood and swelling that I'd seen in the amphitheater is gone though."
    "Sed sanguis et tumor quos in amphitheatro videram evanuerunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:727
translate latin a3s2_8f9d67b3:

    # "He's clean and well-groomed, and his arm seems fine judging by its sturdiness underneath me."
    "Mundus et bene cultus est; brachium quoque eius sanum videtur, si firmitatem eius sub me considero."

# game/a3s2.rpy:728
translate latin a3s2_3be39ed2:

    # "My brief look at him is ended though as Amicus suddenly yanks me back against his chest, sobbing against me."
    "Brevis autem intuitus meus finitur cum Amicus me subito retro ad pectus trahit, contra me singultans."

# game/a3s2.rpy:730
translate latin a3s2_4a9dfd04:

    # "I've seen Amicus cry before, back in the dungeon, but not these gut-wrenching sobs that I can feel heaving through my own body."
    "Amicum antea flentem vidi, in carcere, sed non his singultibus viscera torquentibus, quos per proprium corpus meum concuti sentio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:731
translate latin a3s2_d73f1703:

    # "It serves to shock me to my senses even more."
    "Hoc me etiam magis ad sensus excitat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:732
translate latin a3s2_8b63af6c:

    # "Firmly, I push back against his chest, creating space between us so I can hold his face in my hands."
    "Firmiter me a pectore eius repello, spatium inter nos faciens ut vultum eius manibus tenere possim."

# game/a3s2.rpy:734
translate latin a3s2_031a1acc:

    # "He just looks back at me, crying openly, and I watch as the tears well out of his eyes and seem to disappear into the fur of his cheeks."
    "Ille tantum me respicit, palam flens; lacrimas e oculis eius emergentes observo, quae in pilos genarum evanescere videntur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:735
translate latin a3s2_cfbcae4e:

    # "I'm sure we both want to say a lot in this moment."
    "Certus sum ambos multa hoc momento dicere velle."

# game/a3s2.rpy:736
translate latin a3s2_eca8877d:

    # "What happened, what's happening now, what {i}will{/i} happen, but at this particular moment in time and space, we're back together."
    "Quid acciderit, quid nunc fiat, quid {i}futurum sit{/i}; sed hoc ipso momento temporis et spatii iterum una sumus."

# game/a3s2.rpy:737
translate latin a3s2_6e4671f5:

    # "It's impossible, but it's happening, so I cling to him again, and he just holds me as I press my face against his chest, listening to his hammering heart, squeezing my eyes shut."
    "Impossibile est, sed fit; itaque ei rursus adhaereo et ille tantum me tenet, dum faciem pectori eius admoveo, cor vehementer pulsans auscultans, oculos comprimens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:739
translate latin a3s2_20be12f7:

    # "If this is eternity, then I'm completely fine with it."
    "Si haec aeternitas est, ea omnino contentus sum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:740
translate latin a3s2_72d97618:

    # "I'm not sure how much time passes, but as this thought crosses my mind a few times, my eyes suddenly fly open."
    "Nescio quantum temporis transeat, sed cum haec cogitatio aliquoties mentem subit, oculi mei subito late aperiuntur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:741
translate latin a3s2_abba36ec:

    # "I press back again, looking up at the wolf, holding his face again."
    "Rursus me paulum ab eo removeo, lupum suspiciens et vultum eius iterum tenens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:742
translate latin a3s2_481ed029:

    # m "\"Wait...if you're here, did you...\""
    m "\"Mane...si hic es, num tu...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:743
translate latin a3s2_b34031a9:

    # "I wonder suddenly if maybe Amicus had been seriously wounded in the fight, that he didn't make it after all."
    "Subito miror an Amicus in pugna graviter vulneratus sit, an tamen non supervixerit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:744
translate latin a3s2_1fb272e3:

    # "But Amicus shakes his head gently, his sobs having quieted to subdued sniffles and hiccups."
    "Sed Amicus caput leniter quatit, singultibus ad lenes inspirationes per nares et singultus minores redactis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:746
translate latin a3s2_a0e1ceb3:

    # a "\"No...no, I'm fine. I won. Cato is dead.\""
    a "\"Non...non, bene valeo. Vici. Cato mortuus est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:747
translate latin a3s2_219f9a46:

    # "I'm flooded with relief."
    "Levamento perfundor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:748
translate latin a3s2_2764bdf1:

    # "He strokes my hair gently, slowly, and I wonder why he still looks so sad."
    "Capillos meos leniter, lente permulcet; miror cur adhuc tam tristis videatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:749
translate latin a3s2_3c0d46a6:

    # m "\"But how are you here, aren't I...\""
    m "\"Sed quomodo hic es? Nonne ego...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:750
translate latin a3s2_5ee25c38:

    # "I look around at the infinite space surrounding us."
    "Infinitum spatium quod nos circumdat circumspicio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:751
translate latin a3s2_6aa61197:

    # "The stars and planets are unusually close, stunningly bright, and unimaginably vivid."
    "Stellae et planetae insolite propinqui sunt, mirum in modum clari et ultra imaginationem vividi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:752
translate latin a3s2_839945b1:

    # "The blues, purples, and blacks are deep and monolithic, signaling the endless space that stretches beyond."
    "Colores caerulei, purpurei et nigri profundi atque immensi sunt, spatium infinitum ultra patens indicantes."

# game/a3s2.rpy:753
translate latin a3s2_77cdbcfe:

    # m "\"Am I dead?\""
    m "\"Mortuus sum?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:754
translate latin a3s2_0404e8ff:

    # "Amicus pulls me back against him, forcing me to look away from the churning universe."
    "Amicus me ad se retrahit, ab universo aestuante oculos avertere cogens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:756
translate latin a3s2_8ac0b7d0:

    # a "\"No, you're here.\""
    a "\"Non, hic es.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:757
translate latin a3s2_b0ca33ed:

    # "It sounds more like he's convincing himself rather than me."
    "Ex voce eius Amicus potius sibi quam mihi persuadere videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:758
translate latin a3s2_a6dae190:

    # m "\"But where's 'here'?\""
    m "\"Sed ubi est 'hic'?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:759
translate latin a3s2_4724e75d:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment, and I find myself content to lean against him for a while, just wanting to be close to him."
    "Amicus paulisper tacet; me contentum invenio aliquamdiu ei inniti, tantum prope eum esse volentem."

# game/a3s2.rpy:760
translate latin a3s2_c4f55fca:

    # "At some point Amicus had sat down, and I'm cradled in his lap."
    "Amicus aliquando consederat; in gremio eius sustineor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:761
translate latin a3s2_6c104349:

    # "Considering we're not just floating around in zero gravity, I have to assume there's something solid underneath us somehow."
    "Quia non tantum sine gravitate circumfluitamus, existimare debeo aliquid solidum nescio quo modo sub nobis esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:762
translate latin a3s2_17c00067:

    # "Amicus sniffles again."
    "Amicus iterum naso spiritum trahit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:764
translate latin a3s2_1fee6156:

    # a "\"I melded my mind with the archive to speak to the parents...that's all I know.\""
    a "\"Mentem meam cum archivo coniunxi ut Parentibus loquerer...hoc tantum scio.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:765
translate latin a3s2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Cogito."

# game/a3s2.rpy:766
translate latin a3s2_1995937a:

    # m "\"Did I do the same, then?\""
    m "\"Fecine ego quoque idem igitur?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:767
translate latin a3s2_a3c80254:

    # a "\"I was holding you when I did it...\""
    a "\"Te tenebam cum id feci...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:768
translate latin a3s2_6b2dbe2a:

    # "My neck...the blood..."
    "Collum meum...sanguis..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:769
translate latin a3s2_7102fceb:

    # "I look up at him again."
    "Iterum ad eum sursum aspicio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:770
translate latin a3s2_9a713961:

    # m "\"Amicus...am I alive?\""
    m "\"Amice...vivone?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:771
translate latin a3s2_d3ed9f29:

    # "Amicus looks at me for a moment before his face screws up and tears well up again."
    "Amicus me paulisper aspicit, deinde vultus eius contrahitur et lacrimae iterum emergunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:773
translate latin a3s2_e4483b49:

    # a "\"I...don't know.\""
    a "\"Ego...nescio.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:775
translate latin a3s2_dde9eafe:

    # "He whines out the words and I immediately hug him again."
    "Verba gemens dicit; statim eum iterum amplector."

# game/a3s2.rpy:777
translate latin a3s2_fbdfbfa1:

    # m "\"Hey, I'm okay, see? I'm here.\""
    m "\"Heus, bene me habeo, vides? Hic sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:778
translate latin a3s2_dd8e3908:

    # "Another sobbing fit starts."
    "Alter impetus fletus incipit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:779
translate latin a3s2_4a89a5bb:

    # "And now I know why."
    "Nunc scio cur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:780
translate latin a3s2_ee740b8b:

    # "I must have died, and now, for whatever reason, the parents have let us reunite somehow."
    "Mortuus esse debeo, et nunc, quacumque de causa, Parentes nos nescio quo modo iterum coniungi passi sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:781
translate latin a3s2_b34ba5af:

    # "And I know that Amicus must be wondering the same thing that I am:"
    "Et scio Amicum idem atque ego mirari debere:"

# game/a3s2.rpy:782
translate latin a3s2_792fe4ad:

    # "How long is this going to last?"
    "Quamdiu hoc durabit?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:783
translate latin a3s2_1fd5d565:

    # "I try to think of what to say, in case this is our last moment together, in case I am going to be...absorbed again."
    "Cogitare conor quid dicam, si hoc ultimum est momentum quo una sumus, si iterum...absorbebor."

# game/a3s2.rpy:784
translate latin a3s2_ec98a4a0:

    # "But my mind comes up short in the weirdest of ways, only able to think of things that don't matter."
    "Sed mens mea mirum in modum deficit, nihil nisi res quae nihil referunt cogitare valens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:785
translate latin a3s2_a26ebb43:

    # "So, I settle on what had just happened."
    "Itaque quod modo accidit eligo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:786
translate latin a3s2_c816b9f0:

    # m "\"You're emperor now, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Nunc imperator es, Amice.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:787
translate latin a3s2_f8664859:

    # "Amicus nods against me, not trusting his voice at the moment, apparently."
    "Amicus contra me annuit, voce sua hoc momento uti non audens, ut videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:788
translate latin a3s2_34692129:

    # m "\"I'm so happy for you.\""
    m "\"Tam gaudeo pro te.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:789
translate latin a3s2_46f09cb4:

    # "Now he shakes his head, smearing tears against my cheek."
    "Nunc caput quatit, lacrimas contra genam meam linens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:790
translate latin a3s2_e15044c1:

    # "I hate seeing him like this."
    "Eum talem videre odi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:791
translate latin a3s2_d6280302:

    # "I hate that this might be the last way that I'll see him."
    "Odi cogitare me eum fortasse postremo sic visurum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:792
translate latin a3s2_f16ea218:

    # m "\"Please, don't cry. Let's just...be together right now.\""
    m "\"Quaeso, noli flere. Simpliciter...nunc una simus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:793
translate latin a3s2_ad43f0c1:

    # "I sit up straight and pull his head against {i}my{/i} chest for once, cradling his massive form against me, caressing his ears and neck."
    "Rectus consido et hac saltem vice caput eius contra pectus {i}meum{/i} traho, ingens corpus ad me sustinens, aures et collum permulcens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:794
translate latin a3s2_a1abb416:

    # m "\"I'm okay, I promise you. I went somewhere when I...died.\""
    m "\"Bene me habeo, tibi promitto. Aliquo ivi cum...mortuus sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:795
translate latin a3s2_656577fb:

    # "The word is so strange to say."
    "Tam mirum est illud verbum pronuntiare."

# game/a3s2.rpy:796
translate latin a3s2_f0f46375:

    # m "\"It was really nice, full of people. I wasn't alone. It was peaceful.\""
    m "\"Valde iucundum erat, personis plenum. Solus non eram. Tranquillum erat.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:797
translate latin a3s2_2274206e:

    # "Amicus takes a deep shuddering breath, finally pulling back from my hug."
    "Amicus altum tremulum spiritum ducit, tandem ex amplexu meo recedens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:799
translate latin a3s2_705d5d4b:

    # a "\"That's wonderful, [mc]...But I'm sorry, because I'm not letting you go back there.\""
    a "\"Id mirificum est, [mc]...Sed doleo, quia illuc redire te non sinam.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:800
translate latin a3s2_930eb97a:

    # "Amicus suddenly looks resolute as he smirks through the tears."
    "Amicus subito firmus videtur, per lacrimas subridens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:802
translate latin a3s2_4ea30d8e:

    # a "\"You're coming back with me.\""
    a "\"Mecum redibis.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:803
translate latin a3s2_07e751bf:

    # "His voice breaks several times, and I can tell that he really means it."
    "Vox eius aliquoties frangitur; sentio eum id revera intendere."

# game/a3s2.rpy:804
translate latin a3s2_f8d53104:

    # "He really is certain that he's going to drag me back from the dimension of the dead."
    "Revera certus est se me e dimensione mortuorum retracturum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:805
translate latin a3s2_930b20e1:

    # "I don't know what to say."
    "Nescio quid dicam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:806
translate latin a3s2_37e770e5:

    # "I don't know much about the parents, or the afterlife, but Amicus must, so I trust him."
    "De Parentibus aut vita post mortem multa nescio, sed Amicus scire debet; itaque ei confido."

# game/a3s2.rpy:807
translate latin a3s2_9f5118df:

    # "I smile up at him."
    "Ad eum sursum subrideo."

# game/a3s2.rpy:808
translate latin a3s2_1f228d29:

    # m "\"Okay.\""
    m "\"Bene.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:811
translate latin a3s2_e1d49337:

    # "He smiles back at me, then very suddenly kisses me."
    "Ille mihi subridet, deinde subitissime me osculatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:813
translate latin a3s2_9f4a925c:

    # "It's rough and wet, and he kind of misses my lips, but I kiss back, holding him tightly."
    "Asperum et umidum est; labia mea aliquantum praeterit, sed osculum reddo, eum arcte tenens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:815
translate latin a3s2_3ad6ab1c:

    # "Once he finally draws back, I'm happy to see my wolf back to his usual, confident self...even if he has to keep sniffling with his runny nose."
    "Cum tandem recedit, gaudeo lupum meum ad consuetum animum confidentem redisse...etsi ob nasum fluentem identidem spiritum per nares trahere debet."

# game/a3s2.rpy:816
translate latin a3s2_9b006165:

    # "I look around at the swirling cosmos again."
    "Cosmum circumvolutum iterum circumspicio."

# game/a3s2.rpy:818
translate latin a3s2_57371acb:

    # m "\"Um, can you just...get us out?\""
    m "\"Em, potesne simpliciter...nos hinc educere?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:819
translate latin a3s2_a9cd40b5:

    # "Amicus frowns, looking around himself."
    "Amicus frontem contrahit, circum se aspiciens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:821
translate latin a3s2_57ff040d:

    # a "\"Uh...this is actually my first time doing this, so...I'm not sure.\""
    a "\"Ah...hoc revera primum facio, itaque...certus non sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:822
translate latin a3s2_5910e41d:

    # "Amicus looks behind us, then up and down, then clears his throat."
    "Amicus post nos aspicit, deinde sursum et deorsum, tum gulam purgat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:823
translate latin a3s2_1b3cbd8f:

    # a "\"Er, Com? Com, are you there?\""
    a "\"Ah, Com? Com, ades?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:824
translate latin a3s2_16b8cb94:

    # "Silence."
    "Silentium."

# game/a3s2.rpy:826
translate latin a3s2_059657c0:

    # a "\"Hmmm.\""
    a "\"Hmm.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:827
translate latin a3s2_e0fd3d96:

    # "I can tell that Amicus is already out of ideas."
    "Sentio Amico iam consilia defecisse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:828
translate latin a3s2_a55dda4a:

    # m "\"The parents are doing this, right?\""
    m "\"Parentes hoc faciunt, vero?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:829
translate latin a3s2_dd7cdfce:

    # a "\"I think so, though I've never spoken to them. You actually have more experience with that.\""
    a "\"Credo, quamquam cum eis numquam locutus sum. Tu revera huius rei plus experientiae habes.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:831
translate latin a3s2_7e231633:

    # "Amicus grins at me, then looks back up."
    "Amicus mihi renidet, deinde iterum sursum aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:833
translate latin a3s2_6a8d5b6c:

    # a "\"Maybe if we walk...back.\""
    a "\"Fortasse si...retro ambulamus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:834
translate latin a3s2_aeea7382:

    # "I give Amicus a strange look and just as I'm about to point out the absurdity of walking back to Adastra through infinite space, a booming presence makes itself known."
    "Amicum mirabundus aspicio; cum iam absurditatem notaturus sum ad Adastram per infinitum spatium retro ambulandi, praesentia tonans se patefacit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:835
translate latin a3s2_44312f17:

    # mon "\"I suppose you are finished?\""
    mon "\"Vos finivisse credo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:837
translate latin a3s2_92cfccaf:

    # "Amicus and I both jump and the wolf leaps to his feet, keeping me held in his arms."
    "Amicus et ego ambo exsilimus; lupus in pedes prosilit, me in brachiis retinens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:839
translate latin a3s2_e390dde0:

    # a "\"Who's there!?\""
    a "\"Quis illic est!?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:840
translate latin a3s2_687a2bda:

    # "Amicus shouts into the void, snarling."
    "Amicus in vacuum clamat, fremens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:841
translate latin a3s2_acc36f1f:

    # m "\"It's okay Amicus, it's just the monitor.\""
    m "\"Bene est, Amice, Monitor tantum est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:842
translate latin a3s2_3aa6fb50:

    # "I say it like he's just an old friend of mine."
    "Id dico quasi amicus meus vetus tantum sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:843
translate latin a3s2_9f2dba3e:

    # "Amicus doesn't lower his guard however, and continues to growl into space."
    "Sed Amicus cautelam non deponit atque in spatium fremere pergit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:844
translate latin a3s2_00b2da17:

    # "The monitor expresses his amusement in that silent way of his, but I can understand why Amicus isn't letting his guard down."
    "Monitor delectationem illo suo tacito modo exprimit, sed intellegere possum cur Amicus cautelam non deponat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:845
translate latin a3s2_c5b03f57:

    # "It's evident in the way he's holding me, clutching me tightly to his chest."
    "Patet ex modo quo me tenet, arcte ad pectus premens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:846
translate latin a3s2_6aaad6a4:

    # "He afraid I'm going to be taken back from him."
    "Timet ne ab eo rursus auferar."

# game/a3s2.rpy:847
translate latin a3s2_df3d0cdf:

    # "I am too."
    "Ego quoque."

# game/a3s2.rpy:848
translate latin a3s2_9a2a5f9c:

    # mon "\"If you are, I'll open the channel of communication now.\""
    mon "\"Si ita est, canalem communicationis nunc aperiam.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:849
translate latin a3s2_d72f068f:

    # "Amicus raises an eyebrow."
    "Amicus supercilium tollit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:850
translate latin a3s2_c4f75a83:

    # a "\"What the hell are you talking about?\""
    a "\"Quid tandem dicis?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:851
translate latin a3s2_cf0605ea:

    # mon "\"You wish to speak with the parents, correct? They wish to speak directly with you...at least as directly as is possible.\""
    mon "\"Cum Parentibus loqui vis, nonne? Illi tecum directe loqui volunt...saltem tam directe quam fieri potest.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:852
translate latin a3s2_32433a1c:

    # "There's a pause, and I see the gears turning in Amicus's head as his ears flick."
    "Intervallum est; cogitationes in capite Amici versari video dum aures eius moventur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:854
translate latin a3s2_4eb44ffd:

    # a "\"...Yes.\""
    a "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:855
translate latin a3s2_5cd31eb8:

    # mon "\"Then it is done.\""
    mon "\"Tum factum est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:856
translate latin a3s2_1c65ca70:

    # "The monitor's presence vanishes and suddenly, there's another one."
    "Praesentia Monitoris evanescit et subito altera adest."

# game/a3s2.rpy:857
translate latin a3s2_5f1ab566:

    # "Not one, but many, similar to what I had felt earlier."
    "Non una, sed multae, similes iis quas antea senseram."

# game/a3s2.rpy:858
translate latin a3s2_30fb2fb6:

    # "This is still different."
    "Hoc tamen diversum est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:859
translate latin a3s2_3aca30b5:

    # "Instead of melding together, these entities are distinct and separate from each other."
    "Haec entia non inter se coalescunt; potius inter se distincta et separata sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:860
translate latin a3s2_1dc5a203:

    # "But they're so similar that they could be copies of a single person."
    "Sed tam similia sunt ut unius personae exemplaria esse possint."

# game/a3s2.rpy:861
translate latin a3s2_6cb5f5a5:

    # "Their intentions feel disturbingly uniform, like they're all on the exact same path."
    "Consilia eorum perturbante modo uniformia sentio, quasi omnia prorsus eandem viam sequantur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:862
translate latin a3s2_4b56d051:

    # "Unlike the monitor, who at least felt to be on a similar level as any other sapient, these entities feel...alien."
    "Monitor saltem similis gradus ac quilibet alius Sapiens esse videbatur; haec autem entia...aliena videntur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:863
translate latin a3s2_37512a7d:

    # "Which is a strange thing to feel after everything I've been through, but these things are so different."
    "Qui sensus insolitus est post omnia quae passus sum, sed haec tam diversa sunt."

# game/a3s2.rpy:864
translate latin a3s2_83e9f6b8:

    # "...so..."
    "...tam..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:865
translate latin a3s2_1b33addd:

    # "...different..."
    "...diversa..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:867
translate latin a3s2_0c2a8fde:

    # a "\"Well? Show yourself.\""
    a "\"Quid? Te ostende.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:868
translate latin a3s2_e7e0c949:

    # "Amicus barks at the emptiness, somehow remaining brave in the face of all these titanic presences."
    "Amicus in inanitatem latrat, nescio quo modo coram omnibus illis immensis praesentiis fortis manens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:869
translate latin a3s2_9bd74fc0:

    # m "\"You cannot see us.\""
    m "\"Nos videre non potes.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:871
translate latin a3s2_dc97480c:

    # "His mouth moves on its own, mind suddenly becoming empty, seeming to blend with the space around them."
    "Os humani sua sponte movetur; mens eius subito inanis fit et cum spatio circa eos misceri videtur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:872
translate latin a3s2_15e3739b:

    # "Amicus looks down at the human in confusion."
    "Amicus ad humanum confusus deorsum aspicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:873
translate latin a3s2_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"Quid?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:874
translate latin a3s2_42f192bf:

    # "He stares back."
    "Humanus Amicum respicit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:875
translate latin a3s2_9d350dcf:

    # m "\"We cannot speak directly to you.\""
    m "\"Tibi directe loqui non possumus.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:876
translate latin a3s2_804cd142_2:

    # a "\"[mc]?\""
    a "\"[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:877
translate latin a3s2_29c7a3ea:

    # m "\"But we have other methods...\""
    m "\"Sed alios modos habemus...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:878
translate latin a3s2_1ed85b6b:

    # "Amicus's face morphs from confusion...to horror."
    "Vultus Amici a confusione...ad horrorem mutatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:879
translate latin a3s2_7cbebae0:

    # a "\"Gods...[mc]?\""
    a "\"Di...[mc]?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:880
translate latin a3s2_ebc3432e:

    # "He gives the human a little shake."
    "Humanum paululum quatit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:881
translate latin a3s2_80c0258d:

    # a "\"Hey...\""
    a "\"Heus...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:882
translate latin a3s2_8eea217a:

    # m "\"He can hear you...he is simply occupied at the moment.\""
    m "\"Te audire potest...hoc momento tantum occupatus est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:883
translate latin a3s2_1ab0b2ee:

    # "Amicus bares his teeth, and he begins to shake."
    "Amicus dentes nudat et tremere incipit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:884
translate latin a3s2_3fa72551:

    # "He's not sure if it's from anger, or fear."
    "Nescit an ex ira an ex metu sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:885
translate latin a3s2_2507a891:

    # "Likely both."
    "Probabiliter ex utroque."

# game/a3s2.rpy:886
translate latin a3s2_e489c3af:

    # a "\"If...you don't stop—\""
    a "\"Si...non desistitis—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:887
translate latin a3s2_42382a84:

    # m "\"There is no need to threaten. All is as it should be.\""
    m "\"Minis opus non est. Omnia sunt ut esse debent.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:888
translate latin a3s2_54618166:

    # "Amicus is left to stand there, staring open-mouthed at his lover."
    "Amicus ibi stare relinquitur, amatorem suum ore aperto intuens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:889
translate latin a3s2_e5b6010b:

    # "Something ominous and dark churns in his gut."
    "Aliquid ominosum et tenebrosum in visceribus eius versatur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:890
translate latin a3s2_3afde2a4:

    # "This isn't how he'd envisioned...any of this at all."
    "Non ita sibi...quidquam horum omnino imaginatus erat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:891
translate latin a3s2_74ecb51f:

    # "These are the parents?"
    "Hi Parentes sunt?"

# game/a3s2.rpy:892
translate latin a3s2_9f3d78ab:

    # a "\"What the hell are you?\""
    a "\"Quid, mehercule, estis?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:893
translate latin a3s2_f512fbf1:

    # m "\"We are your guide, your benevolent leader, your parent...\""
    m "\"Dux tuus sumus, rector benevolus, Parens tuus...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:894
translate latin a3s2_a1c05618:

    # "Amicus rubs a paw over the human's forehead gently, looking into those blank, staring eyes."
    "Amicus frontem humani manu leniter permulcet, in oculos vacuos et fixos aspiciens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:895
translate latin a3s2_434a93a4:

    # a "\"Leave him be...please.\""
    a "\"Eum relinquite...quaeso.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:896
translate latin a3s2_eaba3dff:

    # m "\"He is not being harmed. He shall return to a normal state after the channeling is complete.\""
    m "\"Non laeditur. Ad statum solitum redibit postquam transmissio confecta erit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:897
translate latin a3s2_dcedb0ee:

    # a "\"But how?\""
    a "\"Sed quomodo?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:898
translate latin a3s2_77d9dd1d:

    # m "\"Simply put, we are manipulating his behavior through the use of the Lingua.\""
    m "\"Ut rem simpliciter explicemus, rationem qua se gerit per Linguam moderamur.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:899
translate latin a3s2_e22649b5:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, clearly not wanting this at all, but the complete powerlessness he feels right now...it's overwhelming."
    "Amicus caput quatit, hoc plane nolens; sed omnino impotentem se nunc sentit...sensus intolerabilis est."

# game/a3s2.rpy:900
translate latin a3s2_ba6660b9:

    # "The speech he'd been planning for this moment, his intention to tear apart the careless arrogance of the parents, it just dissipates."
    "Oratio quam huic momento paraverat, consilium neglegentem superbiam Parentum dilacerandi, simpliciter evanescit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:901
translate latin a3s2_005738b1:

    # "Seeing [mc] just taken by them like this...it's enough to completely cow any courage he'd once had."
    "Videre [mc] ita ab eis captum...sufficit ut omnem fortitudinem quam olim habuerat penitus frangat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:902
translate latin a3s2_cebf9d82:

    # "And as he stares at the cold eyes of the human, he begins to wonder if this is a nightmare."
    "Dum in frigidos oculos humani spectat, mirari incipit an hoc somnium horrendum sit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:903
translate latin a3s2_27fdab35:

    # "For a brief moment, Amicus wonders if any of this is real, what reality even is right now..."
    "Brevi momento Amicus miratur an quidquam horum verum sit, quid nunc ipsa veritas sit..."

# game/a3s2.rpy:904
translate latin a3s2_1cc10926:

    # m "\"That is not for you to wonder, Amicus. All that matters is that you are the One True Emperor.\""
    m "\"Id tibi quaerendum non est, Amice. Hoc tantum refert: tu es Unus Verus Imperator.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:905
translate latin a3s2_b8d54c73:

    # a "\"What do you want?\""
    a "\"Quid vis?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:906
translate latin a3s2_8addc629:

    # "Amicus stares down at his human, feeling repulsed by what's happening."
    "Amicus humanum suum deorsum intuetur, ab eo quod fit abhorrens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:907
translate latin a3s2_c1f27ea3:

    # m "\"For the work of Drusus to continue...for Adastra to achieve its full potential at last. For the {i}Galaxias{/i} to ascend.\""
    m "\"Ut opus Drusi pergat...ut Adastra tandem omnes facultates suas perficiat. Ut {i}Galaxias{/i} ascendat.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:908
translate latin a3s2_5c0ab6a5:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, trying to focus, trying not to focus on the robotic tone of [mc]'s voice, on the strange way his jaw moves, forced to speak in the wolven tongue."
    "Amicus caput quatit, animum intendere conans et cavens ne ad vocis [mc] sonum machinalem aut ad mirum eius maxillae motum animum attendat; humanus enim lingua Luporum loqui cogitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:909
translate latin a3s2_3d382e9e:

    # a "\"I—I intend to do so...but please, let the human go, and—and heal him...please. He didn't ask for any of this.\""
    a "\"E—ego id facere intendo...sed quaeso, humanum dimittite et—et sanate eum...quaeso. Nihil horum petivit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:910
translate latin a3s2_e9ced3fe:

    # m "\"The human is also involved, Amicus.\""
    m "\"Humanus quoque implicatus est, Amice.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:911
translate latin a3s2_c0ae4030:

    # a "\"But {i}I{/i} involved him.\""
    a "\"Sed {i}ego{/i} eum implicavi.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:912
translate latin a3s2_4d342f8c:

    # m "\"It was meant to be.\""
    m "\"Ita fieri destinatum erat.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:913
translate latin a3s2_81a7d37b:

    # a "\"What—\""
    a "\"Quid—\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:914
translate latin a3s2_a58d7bd4:

    # "Amicus isn't sure if it's his own mind, or the mind of another that brings back the memory of when he'd opened the archives, how Earth had been near the top of the list of profiled planets."
    "Amicus nescit an mens sua an mens alterius memoriam reducat temporis quo archivum aperuerat, quomodo Terra prope summam partem indicis planetarum descriptorum fuerat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:915
translate latin a3s2_d317d9fc:

    # "How it made no sense that an uncontacted world would be on that list at all."
    "Quomodo nulla ratione mundus nondum contactus in illo indice omnino esse debuerit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:916
translate latin a3s2_c202b149:

    # "But now it does make sense...but at the same time even less sense."
    "Sed nunc rationem habet...simul tamen etiam minus rationis."

# game/a3s2.rpy:917
translate latin a3s2_81971203:

    # "Amicus shakes his head, still reeling at the situation he's in, feeling that he's teetering on the edge of madness."
    "Amicus caput quatit, adhuc rebus suis perturbatus, se in limite insaniae vacillare sentiens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:918
translate latin a3s2_4a3dbb85:

    # m "\"Steady. There are many things you do not understand, things that you will never understand, and that is fine. Not all things are meant to be understood by all sapients.\""
    m "\"Constans esto. Multa non intellegis, quae numquam intelleges; id bene est. Non omnia ab omnibus Sapientibus intellegi destinata sunt.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:919
translate latin a3s2_377d33a8:

    # m "\"But you at least understand that the humans are not uncontacted, are they?\""
    m "\"Sed saltem intellegis humanos non esse nondum contactos, vero?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:920
translate latin a3s2_9f7ab979:

    # "Amicus says nothing, knowing that his mind is being read."
    "Amicus nihil dicit, sciens mentem suam legi."

# game/a3s2.rpy:921
translate latin a3s2_30bd3fb1:

    # m "\"Somehow wolven culture is there, so is Khemian culture, Hindo culture...all sibling cultures.\""
    m "\"Nescio quo modo cultus Luporum ibi est, et cultus Khemianus, cultus Hindo...omnes cultus Fratrum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:922
translate latin a3s2_4347ed74:

    # "The parents go silent and Amicus is left to stare at the puppet his lover has been turned into."
    "Parentes tacent; Amicus pupam in quam amator eius mutatus est intueri relinquitur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:923
translate latin a3s2_51f4938b:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth."
    "Amicus dentes comprimit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:924
translate latin a3s2_46fd2bda:

    # a "\"Why?\""
    a "\"Cur?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:925
translate latin a3s2_12003b34:

    # m "\"Because, they were an experimental microcosm...now a successful one, and it is time for them to be integrated into the {i}Galaxias{/i}.\""
    m "\"Quia microcosmus experimentalis erant...nunc prosperus; tempus est ut in {i}Galaxias{/i} integrentur.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:926
translate latin a3s2_6fcb5e4b:

    # "Another moment of silence."
    "Alterum silentii momentum."

# game/a3s2.rpy:927
translate latin a3s2_2d32daa2:

    # a "\"And...you want me to help do this?\""
    a "\"Et...vultis ut ego quoque operam ad hoc perficiendum conferam?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:928
translate latin a3s2_19ec7c5c:

    # m "\"No, your mission is to help unite the siblings. The first step is Khemia.\""
    m "\"Non, munus tuum est Fratres unire adiuvare. Primus gradus Khemia est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:929
translate latin a3s2_2fac330d:

    # a "\"That was already my intention.\""
    a "\"Id iam intendebam.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:930
translate latin a3s2_485e8f15:

    # m "\"That is questionable. The situation is perilous, Khemia is furious after what has happened. You need more guidance, thus why you are here.\""
    m "\"Id dubium est. Res periculosae sunt; Khemia post ea quae acciderunt furiosa est. Ampliore ductu eges, quare hic es.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:931
translate latin a3s2_72052591:

    # "Amicus snarls."
    "Amicus fremit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:932
translate latin a3s2_4d482758:

    # a "\"I'm here for HIM.\""
    a "\"Hic propter ILLUM sum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:933
translate latin a3s2_88395268:

    # "Amicus nods at [mc], at the sapient creature being used as a mouthpiece."
    "Amicus ad [mc] caput inclinat, ad creaturam sapientem pro ore alieno adhibitam."

# game/a3s2.rpy:934
translate latin a3s2_88fda3e6:

    # m "\"You are here for the {i}Galaxias{/i}, and as the emperor, you now have the onus to know all this information, as your father knew, as his father knew, and so on.\""
    m "\"Hic propter {i}Galaxias{/i} es; ut imperator, nunc onus habes haec omnia cognoscendi, sicut pater tuus sciebat, sicut pater eius, atque ita porro.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:935
translate latin a3s2_bb8eac4d:

    # "Amicus grits his teeth again, trying to comprehend what's being told to him despite being completely disturbed by what's happening to [mc]."
    "Amicus dentes iterum comprimit, dicta comprehendere conans quamquam id quod [mc] fit eum penitus perturbat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:936
translate latin a3s2_4b3c3a52:

    # a "\"If you wanted galactic integration, then why have we been competing with each other?\""
    a "\"Si integrationem galacticam volebatis, cur inter nos certavimus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:937
translate latin a3s2_704c2444:

    # m "\"This was assumed by the siblings themselves; competition was never the goal.\""
    m "\"Hoc ipsi Fratres pro vero habuerunt; certatio numquam propositum fuit.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:938
translate latin a3s2_51918e83:

    # a "\"Then why not tell us that? You're supposed to be our guide.\""
    a "\"Tum cur id nobis non dicitis? Ducere nos debetis.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:939
translate latin a3s2_20e8d986:

    # m "\"The process is slow, and careful; interference is a last resort.\""
    m "\"Processus lentus et cautus est; interventus ultimum remedium est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:940
translate latin a3s2_ca93e98c:

    # m "\"This very communication is a last resort as the siblings and children stray further and further from the path every day, and not just the wolves.\""
    m "\"Haec ipsa communicatio ultimum remedium est, cum Fratres et Liberi cotidie magis magisque a via aberrent, neque lupi tantum.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:941
translate latin a3s2_898b900a:

    # m "\"It has taken 20,000 years to reach this point, and that time cannot be wasted.\""
    m "\"Viginti milibus annorum opus fuit ut ad hoc punctum perveniretur; illud tempus frustra consumi non potest.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:942
translate latin a3s2_b94c7dec:

    # a "\"Then why are you telling only me this and not all sapients in the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    a "\"Cur igitur hoc mihi soli dicitis, non omnibus Sapientibus in {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:943
translate latin a3s2_de71baae:

    # "Amicus glares at the face of the human again, stroking the face gently, hating the blank stare he's receiving."
    "Amicus faciem humani iterum torve aspicit, eam leniter permulcens; vacuum autem obtutum quem recipit odit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:944
translate latin a3s2_2ee47604:

    # m "\"As was stated, minimal interference will result in the best outcome. Only select figures are being informed at this stage. A {i}Galaxias{/i} developed independent of interference will better serve the greater cause as a whole.\""
    m "\"Ut dictum est, minimus interventus optimum exitum efficiet. Hoc gradu tantum delectae personae certiores fiunt. {i}Galaxias{/i} sine interventu evolutus maiori causae universae melius serviet.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:945
translate latin a3s2_b271b077:

    # a "\"The greater cause?\""
    a "\"Maiori causae?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:946
translate latin a3s2_fb1509ae:

    # "The stars and planets shift around them, zooming forward, and for a moment Amicus feels as though he might be sick."
    "Stellae et planetae circa eos mutantur, celeriter procedentes; paulisper Amicus sentit se fortasse nauseaturum esse."

# game/a3s2.rpy:947
translate latin a3s2_7d2732c5:

    # "Something dark looms on the edge of the universe, growing slowly, leeching the parts that it touches."
    "Aliquid obscurum in limite universi imminet, lente crescens, partes quas tangit exhauriens."

# game/a3s2.rpy:948
translate latin a3s2_e6c3e29c:

    # m "\"The Other approaches, and it must be confronted.\""
    m "\"Alterum accedit, et ei resistendum est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:949
translate latin a3s2_c54c7e7c:

    # "At this point, Amicus feels unease pierce through his fog of confusion and anger."
    "Nunc Amicus inquietudinem nebulam confusionis iraeque suae penetrantem sentit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:950
translate latin a3s2_c73d7751:

    # a "\"What Other...are we preparing for war against something?\""
    a "\"Quod Alterum...ad bellum contra aliquid nos paramus?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:951
translate latin a3s2_e2605dda:

    # m "\"We must prepare for an event many millennia from now. This is one step of many.\""
    m "\"Ad eventum post multa milia annorum parare nos debemus. Hic unus e multis gradibus est.\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:952
translate latin a3s2_d883c03a:

    # "Amicus lets out a low growl of frustration, the vagueness of this entire situation making his head ache."
    "Amicus humilem fremitum frustrationis edit; incerta tota haec res caput eius dolere facit."

# game/a3s2.rpy:953
translate latin a3s2_c530e32b:

    # a "\"But what does this have to do with [mc]?\""
    a "\"Sed quid hoc ad [mc] pertinet?\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:954
translate latin a3s2_f6d28bd2:

    # "Amicus shifts his hold on the human, just wanting him to come back to consciousness."
    "Amicus modum quo humanum tenet mutat, tantum volens ut ille ad sensus redeat."

# game/a3s2.rpy:955
translate latin a3s2_2babf566:

    # m "\"He must play a role...and you must make a decision, Amicus...\""
    m "\"Ille partes agere debet...et tu consilium capere debes, Amice...\""

# game/a3s2.rpy:957
translate latin a3s2_32ca118a:

    # "Everything seems to come together all at once for Amicus."
    "Omnia Amico simul inter se congruere videntur."

# game/a3s2.rpy:960
translate latin a3s2_32ca118a_1:

    # "Everything seems to come together all at once for Amicus."
    "Omnia Amico simul inter se congruere videntur."

